(317, 'woocommerce_pos_refund_returns_policy', '-Refunds\r\nNo refunds are offered once an order has been placed and processed.\r\nEach item is carefully inspected and documented prior to shipping to ensure quality and accuracy.\r\nRefunds will only be issued if an item is proven to be defective upon arrival due to an error on our end.\r\n\r\n-Exchanges\r\nExchanges may be made within 48 hours of receiving your item. Exchanges are only accepted for items of equal value and must be in original, unworn condition with tags intact.\r\nCustom orders, made-to-measure garments, and final sale pieces are not eligible for exchange.\r\n\r\n-Damaged or Incorrect Items\r\nIf an item arrives damaged or incorrect, please contact our team within 48 hours of delivery with photo or video proof.\r\nOnce verified, a replacement or exchange will be arranged at no additional cost to the customer.\r\n\r\n-Shipping Liability\r\nAmber Leto Designs is not responsible for any damage, loss, or delay caused during shipping after an item has been handed over to the courier.\r\n\r\nCustomers are encouraged to purchase shipping insurance for additional protection.\r\n\r\n-Contact\r\nFor any exchange or issue inquiries, please email:\r\namberletollc@gmail.com\r\n\r\nInclude your order number, contact info, and photos if applicable.', 'on'),
