(4925, 501, '_elementor_data', '[{\"id\":\"090c5b7\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"row\",\"flex_gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":0,\"column\":\"0\",\"row\":\"0\"},\"background_background\":\"gradient\",\"background_color\":\"#F73AA4\",\"background_color_stop\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":28,\"sizes\":[]},\"background_color_b\":\"#FAF1F3\",\"background_gradient_angle\":{\"unit\":\"deg\",\"size\":126,\"sizes\":[]},\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"90\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"60\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"d851b6c\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"50\"}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"1ca66aa\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"About The <br>Designer\\n\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Playfair Display\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":60,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_weight\":\"700\",\"typography_line_height\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":81,\"sizes\":[]},\"title_color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"\"},\"typography_font_size_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":45,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_line_height_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"em\",\"size\":1.1999999999999999555910790149937383830547332763671875,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"c75b07a\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":20,\"sizes\":[]},\"text\":\"Divider\",\"color\":\"#F7D584\",\"weight\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":3,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"divider\"},{\"id\":\"bed59bc\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Tell Amber\\u2019s story, show her personality, and build connection.<\\/p>\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Poppins\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":18,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_weight\":\"400\",\"text_color\":\"#FFFFFF\",\"typography_font_size_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":16,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"69c8f57\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"50\"}},\"elements\":[],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"418cb6e\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"row\",\"flex_gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":30,\"column\":\"30\",\"row\":\"50\"},\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"80\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"132ec9e\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":50},\"animation\":\"fadeInLeft\",\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"60\",\"right\":\"10\",\"bottom\":\"10\",\"left\":\"10\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"b1a02d0\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Meet Amber Leto\",\"title_color\":\"#2B2B2B\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Playfair Display\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":39,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_weight\":\"700\",\"typography_line_height\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":54,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_size_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":35,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"79db31e\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":15,\"sizes\":[]},\"text\":\"Divider\",\"weight\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":3,\"sizes\":[]},\"__globals__\":{\"color\":\"\"},\"color\":\"#F7D584\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"divider\"},{\"id\":\"b8765c6\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Amber Leto is a Scottsdale-based fashion designer with a lifelong passion for turning the ordinary into the extraordinary. With a gifted eye for color, detail, and drama, Amber creates one-ofa-kind gowns, bold denim pieces, and statement accessories that transform every entrance into a moment worth remembering. Before launching her brand, Amber earned multiple degrees in psychology \\u2014 including a Doctorate in Clinical Psychology \\u2014 and built a decades-long career helping people feel confident, safe, and empowered.<\\/p><p>That same drive to uplift others now fuels her fashion work, where each design is handcrafted to celebrate individuality and inspire main-character energy.<\\/p>\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Poppins\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":16,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_weight\":\"400\",\"typography_line_height\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":31,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"5ca0cf0\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":50},\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"background_color_b\":\"#F194C7\",\"background_gradient_type\":\"radial\",\"background_gradient_position\":\"bottom right\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"00e105c\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/amberleto.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/10\\/Amber-About-page.jpeg\",\"id\":295,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"-250\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"_animation\":\"zoomIn\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":75,\"sizes\":[]},\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"b49afdc\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"row\",\"flex_gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":0,\"column\":\"0\",\"row\":\"0\"},\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"60\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"80\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"0062a2b\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"flex_direction\":\"row\",\"flex_gap\":{\"column\":\"40\",\"row\":\"40\",\"isLinked\":false,\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":40},\"box_shadow_box_shadow\":{\"horizontal\":10,\"vertical\":10,\"blur\":32,\"spread\":0,\"color\":\"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15)\"},\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"f4602e8\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"50\"},\"background_color_stop\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":20,\"sizes\":[]},\"background_color_b\":\"#F7F7F4\",\"background_gradient_angle\":{\"unit\":\"deg\",\"size\":40,\"sizes\":[]},\"__globals__\":{\"background_color\":\"\"},\"background_color\":\"#EE937A\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"aae35ad\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"background_color\":\"#EE937A\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"8c4ae6a\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":260,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"spacer\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"45b1df6\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/amberleto.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/10\\/Amber-Leto-Group-Shot-scaled-1.jpg\",\"id\":337,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":80,\"sizes\":[]},\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"_animation\":\"zoomIn\",\"_position\":\"absolute\",\"_offset_y\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":41,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"c006d6e\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":50,\"sizes\":[]},\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"20\",\"right\":\"25\",\"bottom\":\"25\",\"left\":\"45\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"87f6cb5\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Amber also lives with <strong>Ehlers-Danlos Syndrome (EDS)<\\/strong>, a rare and often debilitating connective tissue disorder. While EDS brings its challenges, it has never stopped her from creating, innovating, and pushing the limits of what\\u2019s possible in fashion. In fact, her perseverance through adversity is stitched into every piece \\u2014 a reminder that beauty and strength can coexist in the most dazzling ways.<\\/p><p>Her style is theatrical, unapologetically feminine, and rooted in maximalism. From untamed leopard prints to oversized bows and glittering embellishments, Amber\\u2019s pieces dare women to be seen, to be unforgettable, and to never apologize for stealing the show.<\\/p><p>As the creator of <strong>Amber Leto Designs \\u2122 + No Vacancies by Amber Leto \\u2122<\\/strong> , she continues to push boundaries, creating couture-meetscostume collections for fearless women around the world. Because in Amber\\u2019s world, fashion isn\\u2019t just worn \\u2014 it\\u2019s experienced.<\\/p><p><em>\\u201cI don\\u2019t just design clothes\\u2026 I dress moments.\\u201d<\\/em><\\/p>\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Poppins\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":16,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_weight\":\"400\",\"typography_line_height\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":31,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"28e5728\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"row\",\"flex_gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":80,\"column\":\"80\",\"row\":\"40\"},\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"130\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"80\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"hide_desktop\":\"hidden-desktop\",\"hide_tablet\":\"hidden-tablet\",\"hide_mobile\":\"hidden-mobile\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"7fb9a21\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":50},\"animation\":\"fadeInLeft\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"73d9444\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"title\":\"Timeless Silhouettes. Modern Edge. \\n\",\"title_color\":\"#2B2B2B\",\"__globals__\":{\"typography_typography\":\"\"},\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Playfair Display\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":39,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_weight\":\"700\",\"typography_line_height\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":54,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_size_tablet\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":35,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"heading\"},{\"id\":\"8c6a690\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":15,\"sizes\":[]},\"text\":\"Divider\",\"weight\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":3,\"sizes\":[]},\"__globals__\":{\"color\":\"\"},\"color\":\"#F7D584\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"divider\"},{\"id\":\"4b85856\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"editor\":\"<p>Nulla eleifend scelerisque vulputate. Mauris lobortis a mauris eu convallis. Morbi vulputate nisi eget maximus vehicula. Vestibulum mattis consectetur ligula, id suscipit quam dapibus vel. Maecenas molestie.<\\/p><p>Enim sit amet suscipit imperdiet, justo diam semper leo, quis finibus sapien eros et est. In hac habitasse platea dictumst. Etiam non dolor dapibus ligula mollis ornare vulputate eget elit. Maecenas bibendum placerat.<\\/p>\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Poppins\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":16,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_weight\":\"400\",\"typography_line_height\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":31,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"abf082d\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\"