or, detail, and drama, Amber creates one-ofa-kind gowns, bold denim pieces, and statement accessories that transform every entrance into a moment worth remembering. Before launching her brand, Amber earned multiple degrees in psychology \\u2014 including a Doctorate in Clinical Psychology \\u2014 and built a decades-long career helping people feel confident, safe, and empowered.<\\/p><p>That same drive to uplift others now fuels her fashion work, where each design is handcrafted to celebrate individuality and inspire main-character energy.<\\/p>\",\"typography_typography\":\"custom\",\"typography_font_family\":\"Poppins\",\"typography_font_size\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":16,\"sizes\":[]},\"typography_font_weight\":\"400\",\"typography_line_height\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":31,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"text-editor\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"5ca0cf0\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":50},\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"background_color_b\":\"#F194C7\",\"background_gradient_type\":\"radial\",\"background_gradient_position\":\"bottom right\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"00e105c\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/amberleto.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/10\\/Amber-About-page.jpeg\",\"id\":295,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"-250\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"_animation\":\"zoomIn\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":75,\"sizes\":[]},\"align\":\"center\"},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"}],\"isInner\":true}],\"isInner\":false},{\"id\":\"b49afdc\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"row\",\"flex_gap\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":0,\"column\":\"0\",\"row\":\"0\"},\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"60\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"80\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"0062a2b\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"flex_direction\":\"row\",\"flex_gap\":{\"column\":\"40\",\"row\":\"40\",\"isLinked\":false,\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":40},\"box_shadow_box_shadow\":{\"horizontal\":10,\"vertical\":10,\"blur\":32,\"spread\":0,\"color\":\"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15)\"},\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false}},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"f4602e8\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"flex_direction\":\"column\",\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":\"50\"},\"background_color_stop\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":20,\"sizes\":[]},\"background_color_b\":\"#F7F7F4\",\"background_gradient_angle\":{\"unit\":\"deg\",\"size\":40,\"sizes\":[]},\"__globals__\":{\"background_color\":\"\"},\"background_color\":\"#EE937A\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"aae35ad\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"background_background\":\"classic\",\"background_color\":\"#EE937A\"},\"elements\":[{\"id\":\"8c4ae6a\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"space\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":260,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"spacer\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"45b1df6\",\"elType\":\"widget\",\"settings\":{\"image\":{\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/amberleto.com\\/wp-content\\/uploads\\/2025\\/10\\/Amber-Leto-Group-Shot-scaled-1.jpg\",\"id\":337,\"size\":\"\",\"alt\":\"\",\"source\":\"library\"},\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":80,\"sizes\":[]},\"_margin\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"0\",\"right\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\",\"left\":\"0\",\"isLinked\":false},\"_animation\":\"zoomIn\",\"_position\":\"absolute\",\"_offset_y\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"size\":41,\"sizes\":[]}},\"elements\":[],\"widgetType\":\"image\"}],\"isInner\":true},{\"id\":\"c006d6e\",\"elType\":\"container\",\"settings\":{\"content_width\":\"full\",\"width\":{\"unit\":\"%\",\"size\":50,\"sizes\":[]},\"padding\":{\"unit\":\"px\",\"top\":\"20\",\"ri