kup/amberleto/website/?p=62', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(67, 1, '2025-10-16 18:08:23', '2025-10-16 18:08:23', '<span class=\"a_GcMg font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\">A playful yet elegant dress featuring crisp blue-and-black plaid, layered with sparkling aqua tulle panels and finished with satin bows and floral appliqués. Elastic waist ensures a snug yet comfortable fit, making it perfect for everyday chic or pet parties. Designed for cats and small dogs ready to turn heads.</span>', 'Blue Plaid Bloom Tulle - PET', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'blue-plaid-bloom-tulle-pet', '', '', '2026-03-17 23:33:20', '2026-03-17 23:33:20', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?post_type=product&#038;p=67', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(68, 1, '2025-10-16 18:08:23', '2025-10-16 18:08:23', 'She’s got bite and beauty. Leopard Claw is a fierce bodycon fantasy blending power, sensuality, and pure high fashion heat. Featuring a structured sweetheart bodice with sculpted cups and a full-length sheer mesh overlay, this gown hugs every curve while delivering a bold claw-marked illusion with velvet leopard appliqué. The daring thigh high slit and jet-black feather trim whisper drama with every step, while gold claw rings and accessories add that unapologetic edge.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Fit: Form-fitting with flexible bust and leg room</li>\r\n 	<li>Care: Dry clean only</li>\r\n 	<li>Leopard Claw Gown (Sweetheart Mesh Overlay): LP-LL-L11-DR-MLT-S</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Leopard Claw Bodysuit', 'She’s got bite and beauty. Leopard Claw is a fierce bodycon fantasy blending power, sensuality, and pure high fashion heat.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lorem-ipsum', '', '', '2025-11-06 22:45:58', '2025-11-06 22:45:58', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?post_type=product&#038;p=68', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(69, 1, '2025-10-16 18:08:23', '2025-10-16 18:08:23', 'A full fantasy in feline flair, this editorial-ready ensemble mixes sheer mesh, feathers, and fierce attitude. The leopard mesh turtleneck top hugs the body while a dramatic black tulle bow adds exaggerated edge. Paired with a lush feathered mini skirt that moves with every step, plus bold accessories that scream “main character,” this look is made for divas who don’t do subtle.', 'Caged Kitty Couture', 'A full fantasy in feline flair, this editorial-ready ensemble mixes sheer mesh, feathers, and fierce attitude. The leopard mesh turtleneck top hugs the body while a dramatic black tulle bow adds exaggerated edge.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lorem-ipsum-2', '', '', '2025-11-06 22:46:31', '2025-11-06 22:46:31', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?post_type=product&#038;p=69', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(71, 1, '2025-10-16 18:08:23', '2025-10-16 18:08:23', 'This layered hi-lo moment blends animal instinct with golden goddess glam. The stretch jersey top hugs in all the right places, while the cascading ruffle skirt delivers volume, texture, and a whole lot of runway magic. Finished with a leopard floral appliqué on the shoulder, it’s safari—but make it slay.', 'Safari Sundae', 'This layered hi-lo moment blends animal instinct with golden goddess glam. The stretch jersey top hugs in all the right places, while the cascading ruffle skirt delivers volume, texture, and a whole lot of runway magic.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lorem-ipsum-4', '', '', '2025-11-06 22:18:28', '2025-11-06 22:18:28', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?post_type=product&#038;p=71', 0, 'product', '', 0),
