(79, 1, '2025-10-16 18:08:23', '2025-10-16 18:08:23', 'A cottage core fantasy meets streetwear sass in this flirty, feminine set. The look includes a hand-embellished denim vest adorned with florals and sequins, a lace and tulle bandeau top, and a pleated denim-ruffle mini skirt topped with signature floral appliqués. Statement sheer gloves and 3D floral sunglasses elevate the outfit into full fairy tale couture.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Care: Spot clean or dry clean only</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Garden Glam Set', 'A cottage core fantasy meets streetwear sass in this flirty, feminine set. The look includes a hand-embellished denim vest adorned with florals and sequins.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lorem-ipsum-11', '', '', '2025-11-06 22:26:17', '2025-11-06 22:26:17', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?post_type=product&#038;p=79', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(80, 1, '2025-10-16 18:08:23', '2025-10-16 18:08:23', 'A cottage core fantasy meets streetwear sass in this flirty, feminine set. The look includes a hand-embellished denim vest adorned with florals and sequins, a lace and tulle bandeau top, and a pleated denim-ruffle mini skirt topped with signature floral appliqués. Statement sheer gloves and 3D floral sunglasses elevate the outfit into full fairy tale couture', 'Floral Glam Set', 'A cottage core fantasy meets streetwear sass in this flirty, feminine set. The look includes a hand-embellished denim vest adorned with florals and sequins.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lorem-ipsum-12', '', '', '2025-11-06 22:28:11', '2025-11-06 22:28:11', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?post_type=product&#038;p=80', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(81, 1, '2025-10-16 18:08:23', '2025-10-16 18:08:23', 'This two-piece denim set pairs a sculpted sweetheart crop top with asymmetrical high-slit denim shorts. The top features corset-style seam work and a structured fit, while the shorts offer raw frayed edges, a dual-belt illusion waistband, and a handcrafted denim flower appliqué with soft blue tulle accents. Designed to turn heads, this playful yet tailored look blends streetwear edge with couture whimsy.', 'Blue Blossom Set', 'This two-piece denim set pairs a sculpted sweetheart crop top with asymmetrical high-slit denim shorts. The top features corset-style seam work and a structured fit, while the shorts offer raw frayed edges,', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lorem-ipsum-13', '', '', '2025-11-06 22:24:28', '2025-11-06 22:24:28', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?post_type=product&#038;p=81', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(82, 1, '2025-10-16 18:08:23', '2025-10-16 18:08:23', 'Flirty, fearless, and fully denim. This bold two-piece set features a strapless button-front denim top with pocket flap accents and delicate floral appliqué. Paired with a double-ruffle tiered mini skirt in rich indigo wash, it’s the perfect mix of playful and power.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Care: Hand wash cold or dry clean</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Ruffle Riot Set', 'Flirty, fearless, and fully denim. This bold two-piece set features a strapless button-front denim top with pocket flap accents and delicate floral appliqué.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lorem-ipsum-14', '', '', '2025-11-06 22:25:29', '2025-11-06 22:25:29', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?post_type=product&#038;p=82', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(83, 1, '2025-10-16 18:08:23', '2025-10-16 18:08:23', 'Laid-back never looked this luxe. This dazzling two-piece look pairs comfy drawstring denim shorts with an\r\nembellished sleeveless top, featuring a sheer rhinestone overlay and denim underlayer. Subtle sparkle, featherlike\r\nappliqué, and a touch of attitude make this casual set festival- or runway-ready\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Care: Hand wash cold, lay flat to dry</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Starry Nights Shorts Set', 'Laid-back never looked this luxe. This dazzling two-piece look pairs comfy drawstring denim shorts with an\r\nembellished sleeveless top, featuring a sheer rhinestone overlay and denim underlayer.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lorem-ipsum-15', '', '', '2025-11-06 22:22:18', '2025-11-06 22:22:18', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?post_type=product&#038;p=83', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(84, 1, '2025-10-16 18:08:23', '2025-10-16 18:08:23', 'A bold fusion of flirty and feminine, this four-piece set includes a white sweetheart corset top adorned with an oversized denim bow, paired with ultra-low-rise triple-belt denim shorts. Statement details include a sculpted tulle accented denim flower shoulder brooch, matching floral earrings, and a tailored denim cap topped with multitoned handmade blossoms. This look is custom couture with undeniable personality.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Care: Spot clean or dry clean only. Store hat and florals in breathable packaging.</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Petal Parade Set', 'A bold fusion of flirty and feminine, this four-piece set includes a white sweetheart corset top adorned with an oversized denim bow, paired with ultra-low-rise triple-belt denim shorts', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lorem-ipsum-16', '', '', '2025-11-06 22:22:56', '2025-11-06 22:22:56', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?post_type=product&#038;p=84', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(86, 1, '2025-10-16 18:08:23', '2025-10-16 18:08:23', 'This unapologetically edgy set blends romantic whimsy with street couture. The lace-up distressed denim bustier is trimmed with hand-sewn floral appliqués and layers of powder blue tulle, matched with frayed mid-rise denim shorts featuring peekaboo distressing and a soft tulle bustle. A dramatic denim headpiece with feathered detail and sculpted florals completes the runway-ready fantasy.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Care: Dry clean recommended due to delicate construction</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Lace Me Wild', 'This unapologetically edgy set blends romantic whimsy with street couture. The lace-up distressed denim bustier is trimmed with hand-sewn floral appliqués and layers of powder blue tulle, matched with frayed mid-rise denim shorts featuring peekaboo distressing and a soft tulle bustle.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lorem-ipsum-18', '', '', '2025-11-06 22:23:38', '2025-11-06 22:23:38', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?post_type=product&#038;p=86', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(87, 1, '2025-10-16 18:08:24', '2025-10-16 18:08:24', 'Turn heads in this vibrant hot-pink three-piece swim set that sparkles under the sun. The triangle bikini top and low-rise bottoms are adorned with rhinestone accents, while a sheer mesh cover-up ties it all together with playful glam. Heart-shaped charms at the waist add an extra touch of flirty drama, making this the ultimate pool-to-party look.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Care: Hand wash cold, lay flat to dry. Do not bleach.</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Heartbreaker Bikini Set', 'Turn heads in this vibrant hot-pink three-piece swim set that sparkles under the sun. The triangle bikini top and low-rise bottoms are adorned with rhinestone accents, while a sheer mesh cover-up ties it all together with playful glam. Heart-shaped charms at the waist add an extra touch of flirty drama, making this the ultimate pool-to-party look.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lorem-ipsum-19', '', '', '2026-02-10 20:55:05', '2026-02-10 20:55:05', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?post_type=product&#038;p=87', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(88, 1, '2025-10-16 18:08:24', '2025-10-16 18:08:24', 'Sweet as candy, this pastel pink bikini set is trimmed with ruffled edges, delicate bows, and tiny floral appliqués for the ultimate feminine touch. The triangle-cut top and tie-side bottoms keep the fit adjustable, while the playful details make this set perfect for a fun pool party or a dreamy beach day.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Care: Hand wash cold, lay flat to dry. Avoid soaking to preserve embellishments.</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Sugar Rush Bikini', 'Sweet as candy, this pastel pink bikini set is trimmed with ruffled edges, delicate bows, and tiny floral appliqués for the ultimate feminine touch.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lorem-ipsum-20', '', '', '2026-02-10 20:56:29', '2026-02-10 20:56:29', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?post_type=product&#038;p=88', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(89, 1, '2025-10-16 18:08:24', '2025-10-16 18:08:24', 'Bring out your untamed side with this bold leopard-print one-piece featuring sultry side cutouts and a plunging neckline. The halter tie adds adjustable comfort while the cutout design sculpts the waist for a sleek, flattering silhouette. Perfect for the woman who wants all eyes on her, this piece blends wild energy with sophisticated edge.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Care: Hand wash cold, lay flat to dry. Avoid wringing to preserve shape.</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Wildcat Cutout', 'Bring out your untamed side with this bold leopard-print one-piece featuring sultry side cutouts and a plunging neckline.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lorem-ipsum-21', '', '', '2026-02-10 20:57:22', '2026-02-10 20:57:22', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?post_type=product&#038;p=89', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(90, 1, '2025-10-16 18:08:24', '2025-10-16 18:08:24', 'Make waves in this electric-blue bikini set that’s all about bold simplicity with a luxe twist. The halter-style top and tie-side bottoms are elevated with crystal hoop hardware and dangling charm details, giving the classic cut a glamorous upgrade. Perfect for beach days, pool parties, or resort getaways — this bikini is confidence in color.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Care: Hand wash cold, lay flat to dry. Avoid prolonged exposure to chlorine and saltwater to preserve color vibrancy.</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Ocean Eyes Bikini', 'Make waves in this electric-blue bikini set that’s all about bold simplicity with a luxe twist. The halter-style top and tie-side bottoms are elevated with crystal hoop hardware and dangling charm details, giving the classic cut a glamorous upgrade.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lorem-ipsum-22', '', '', '2026-02-10 20:58:11', '2026-02-10 20:58:11', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?post_type=product&#038;p=90', 0, 'product', '', 0);
