(91, 1, '2025-10-16 18:08:24', '2025-10-16 18:08:24', 'Sweet as candy, this pastel pink bikini set is trimmed with ruffled edges, delicate bows, and tiny floral appliqués for the ultimate feminine touch. The triangle-cut top and tie-side bottoms keep the fit adjustable, while the playful details make this set perfect for a fun pool party or a dreamy beach day.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Care: Hand wash cold, lay flat to dry. Remove chain before washing.</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Golden Hour Breeze', 'Sweet as candy, this pastel pink bikini set is trimmed with ruffled edges, delicate bows, and tiny floral appliqués for the ultimate feminine touch.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lorem-ipsum-23', '', '', '2026-02-10 20:59:18', '2026-02-10 20:59:18', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?post_type=product&#038;p=91', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(92, 1, '2025-10-16 18:08:24', '2025-10-16 18:08:24', '<strong>Lorem Ipsum</strong> is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book.', 'Lorem Ipsum', '<strong>Lorem Ipsum</strong> is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book.', 'private', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lorem-ipsum-24', '', '', '2025-11-06 22:41:23', '2025-11-06 22:41:23', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?post_type=product&#038;p=92', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(93, 1, '2025-10-16 18:08:24', '2025-10-16 18:08:24', 'Playful, pouty, and primed for a main character moment — this schoolgirl remix is giving grown-up edge with a dash of mischief. The cropped white button-down features puffed sleeves and a bold triple bow bust detail crafted in signature red plaid, bringing charm and cheek in equal measure. Paired with voluminous red puff shorts adorned with a dramatic black rosette, this two-piece set is flirty, fearless, and ready to stir up some drama in the lunchroom (or the boardroom).\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Care Instructions: Dry clean or spot clean only. Handle decorative elements with care.</li>\r\n 	<li>Size Range: 0–8 (custom sizing available upon request)</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Citrus Sequin Bloom', 'Playful, pouty, and primed for a main character moment — this schoolgirl remix is giving grown-up edge with a dash of mischief.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lorem-ipsum-25', '', '', '2026-02-10 20:40:10', '2026-02-10 20:40:10', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?post_type=product&#038;p=93', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(94, 1, '2025-10-16 18:08:24', '2025-10-16 18:08:24', 'Drape yourself in retro charm with a modern twist. The Crimson Couture Jumper Dress is a playful nod to vintage schoolgirl silhouettes, reimagined with bold elegance. This double-breasted mini jumper in a rich red hue features silver button details and a voluminous black rosette at the hem. Paired with a crisp puff-sleeve blouse and oversized satin bow tie, this look exudes confident femininity with a dash of theatrical flair.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Care Instructions: Dry clean only</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Crimson Jumper Dress', 'Drape yourself in retro charm with a modern twist. The Crimson Couture Jumper Dress is a playful nod to vintage schoolgirl silhouettes, reimagined with bold elegance.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lorem-ipsum-26', '', '', '2026-02-10 20:43:39', '2026-02-10 20:43:39', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?post_type=product&#038;p=94', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(95, 1, '2025-10-16 18:08:24', '2025-10-16 18:08:24', 'For the rule-breakers and statement-makers — this daring set fuses punk edge with romantic flair. The off-shoulder top stuns in cherry red, detailed with dimensional black floral appliqués and a statement crystal brooch for extra heat. Paired with a high-shine faux leather pencil skirt adorned with bold red sequin blooms, it’s giving unapologetic glam from sidewalk to spotlight.', 'Cutie Patootie', 'For the rule-breakers and statement-makers — this daring set fuses punk edge with romantic flair. The off-shoulder top stuns in cherry red, detailed with dimensional black floral appliqués and a statement crystal brooch for extra heat.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lorem-ipsum-27', '', '', '2026-02-10 20:41:21', '2026-02-10 20:41:21', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?post_type=product&#038;p=95', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(96, 1, '2025-10-16 18:08:24', '2025-10-16 18:08:24', 'Bold and cheeky, this two-piece look puts a theatrical spin on timeless plaid. The blouse features a rich red-and black check red print with sequin appliqué and a black lace waist peplum that cinches with vintage flair. The matching fitted skirt keeps it punchy in oversized buffalo plaid, accented with a dramatic oversized flower appliqué. The cherry drop earrings, sculpted heart glasses, and velvet oversized collar hat complete the outfit with a flair that’s equal parts retro kitsch and runway-ready sass.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Care Instructions: Dry clean only. Avoid excessive moisture near lace and embellishments.</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Midnight Butterfly Fantasy', 'Bold and cheeky, this two-piece look puts a theatrical spin on timeless plaid. The blouse features a rich red-and black check red print with sequin appliqué and a black lace waist peplum that cinches with vintage flair.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lorem-ipsum-28', '', '', '2026-02-10 20:42:16', '2026-02-10 20:42:16', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?post_type=product&#038;p=96', 0, 'product', '', 0),
