(128, 1, '2025-10-16 18:08:36', '2025-10-16 18:08:36', 'A little bit schoolgirl, a whole lot of edge. This red plaid one-shoulder corset mini commands attention with luxe floral appliqué, black mesh flower detailing, and draped gold chain accents. Designed for the bold, the brash, and the beautifully rebellious, this mini dress makes plaid runway-ready with structure, flair, and attitude.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Care Instructions: Spot clean or dry clean only</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Plaid Boss Babe Mini', 'A little bit schoolgirl, a whole lot of edge. This red plaid one-shoulder corset mini commands attention with luxe floral appliqué, black mesh flower detailing, and draped gold chain accents.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lorem-ipsum-29', '', '', '2026-02-10 20:29:47', '2026-02-10 20:29:47', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?post_type=product&#038;p=128', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(129, 1, '2025-10-16 18:08:36', '2025-10-16 18:08:36', 'Unapologetically bold, the Plaid &amp; Petals Power Dress fuses punk rebellion with red carpet elegance. This one shoulder mini stuns in crimson plaid, elevated with rich gold-and-black floral appliqué and an oversized mesh rose bursting from the shoulder. Finished with a dramatic chain belt and bold side bloom, this look doesn’t whisper — it commands.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Care Instructions: Spot clean or dry clean only. Store flat or hang carefully to avoid crushing appliqué.</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Plaid & Petals Power', 'Unapologetically bold, the Plaid &amp; Petals Power Dress fuses punk rebellion with red carpet elegance. This one shoulder mini stuns in crimson plaid, elevated with rich gold-and-black floral appliqué and an oversized mesh rose bursting from the shoulder.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lorem-ipsum-30', '', '', '2026-02-10 20:30:24', '2026-02-10 20:30:24', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?post_type=product&#038;p=129', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(130, 1, '2025-10-16 18:08:36', '2025-10-16 18:08:36', 'Drape yourself in untamed drama with this fierce, high-fashion mini. The Dangerously Divine Dress turns every hallway into a catwalk with its sheer black mesh base, voluminous red ruffle appliqués, and bold faux fur trim. Oversized floral elements on the bust and hip sculpt a daring silhouette that screams haute couture rebellion. The wrist cuffs add extra flair for those ready to strike a pose and own the night', 'Dangerously Divine', 'Drape yourself in untamed drama with this fierce, high-fashion mini. The Dangerously Divine Dress turns every hallway into a catwalk with its sheer black mesh base, voluminous red ruffle appliqués, and bold faux fur trim.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lorem-ipsum-31', '', '', '2026-02-10 20:31:25', '2026-02-10 20:31:25', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?post_type=product&#038;p=130', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(131, 1, '2025-10-16 18:08:36', '2025-10-16 18:08:36', 'This bold and flirtatious ensemble blends classic prep with a rebellious twist. The crimson red mini dress features plaid-trimmed ruffles, a lace-up corset bodice, and pleated hemline, layered over a billowy white blouse with dramatic sleeves. Gold chains and plaid bows add a cheeky accent, while the matching cap seals the school girl gone-rogue fantasy\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Care Instructions: Spot clean or dry clean only. Store chains carefully to avoid tangling.</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Plaid Ruffle Mini Set', 'This bold and flirtatious ensemble blends classic prep with a rebellious twist. The crimson red mini dress features plaid-trimmed ruffles, a lace-up corset bodice, and pleated hemline, layered over a billowy white blouse with dramatic sleeves.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lorem-ipsum-32', '', '', '2026-02-10 20:32:34', '2026-02-10 20:32:34', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?post_type=product&#038;p=131', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(132, 1, '2025-10-16 18:08:36', '2025-10-16 18:08:36', 'Command the room in this bold yet playful ensemble that blends classic punk vibes with modern high fashion. The form-fitting red turtleneck is detailed with dimensional black rose appliqués, giving a nod to theatrical romance. Paired with red and black plaid shorts, the set features a draped gold chain accent and a surprise red tulle train cascading from the back for dramatic flair. A matching red hat with black rosettes and netting completes the look — perfect for fashion shows, creative editorials, and style-forward statements.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Care Instructions: Spot clean or dry clean only. Store hat with care to preserve shape.</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Plaid Parade Set', 'Command the room in this bold yet playful ensemble that blends classic punk vibes with modern high fashion. The form-fitting red turtleneck is detailed with dimensional black rose appliqués, giving a nod to theatrical romance.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lorem-ipsum-33', '', '', '2026-02-10 20:34:35', '2026-02-10 20:34:35', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?post_type=product&#038;p=132', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(134, 1, '2025-10-16 18:08:36', '2025-10-16 18:08:36', 'This couture-style stunner commands the spotlight with its oversized 3D red rose bodice layered over a sheer purple long-sleeve base. The waist is cinched with a red tulle sash featuring cascading gold chains, adding glitz and movement. A multi-tiered ombré skirt fades from deep violet to fuchsia, creating rich visual drama with every step. Inspired by Latin romance and avant-garde fashion, this gown is made for icons—not wallflowers.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Care Instructions: Dry clean only. Avoid steam directly on flower structure.</li>\r\n 	<li>Special Note: Includes matching red rose hair accessory</li>\r\n</ul>', 'La Rosa Flamengo Fantasy', 'This couture-style stunner commands the spotlight with its oversized 3D red rose bodice layered over a sheer purple long-sleeve base. The waist is cinched with a red tulle sash featuring cascading gold chains, adding glitz and movement.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lorem-ipsum-35', '', '', '2026-02-10 20:35:40', '2026-02-10 20:35:40', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?post_type=product&#038;p=134', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(135, 1, '2025-10-16 18:08:36', '2025-10-16 18:08:36', 'Command attention in this fiery, editorial-ready set that mixes playful asymmetry with glam rock edge. The cropped top is a bold statement in cherry red, adorned with black floral appliqués and shimmering crystal brooch accents. Sculptural white off-shoulder sleeves and matching black mesh accessories give this piece couture-level drama. Paired with a sleek black faux leather pencil skirt that hugs the hips and finishes with fiery red sequin floral appliqués, this look was made for the spotlight.', 'Red Alert Rebel', 'Command attention in this fiery, editorial-ready set that mixes playful asymmetry with glam rock edge. The cropped top is a bold statement in cherry red, adorned with black floral appliqués and shimmering crystal brooch accents. .', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lorem-ipsum-36', '', '', '2026-02-10 20:36:40', '2026-02-10 20:36:40', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?post_type=product&#038;p=135', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(137, 1, '2025-10-16 18:08:36', '2025-10-16 18:08:36', 'Theatrical elegance meets cheeky rebellion in The Big Finish, a playful plaid ensemble designed to turn heads and steal the spotlight. This look features a black mesh long-sleeve mock neck bodysuit paired with a custom asymmetrical tartan mini skirt that cascades into a soft tail in the back. A sculpted black rose detail and double gold chain belt add flair, while the true showstopper is the oversized red satin bow placed at the lower back— commanding attention with every step. Red ruffle-embellished platform heels complete the fantasy, bringing flirty confidence to life.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Care Instructions: Dry clean only. Handle bow and mesh with care to preserve shape and texture.</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Red Bow Tartan', 'Theatrical elegance meets cheeky rebellion in The Big Finish, a playful plaid ensemble designed to turn heads and steal the spotlight. This look features a black mesh long-sleeve mock neck bodysuit paired with a custom asymmetrical tartan mini skirt that cascades into a soft tail in the back.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lorem-ipsum-38', '', '', '2026-02-10 20:37:35', '2026-02-10 20:37:35', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?post_type=product&#038;p=137', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(139, 1, '2025-10-16 18:08:36', '2025-10-16 18:08:36', 'Step into elegance with this cream-toned faux-fur mini set, adorned with gold floral appliqués that shimmer with every move. The fitted long-sleeve mesh top pairs seamlessly with the textured fur skirt, while a delicate chain belt adds movement and sophistication. Designed for statement moments, this look balances warmth and glam with effortless grace.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Care: Spot clean only. Professional dry clean recommended for longevity.</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Heartbreaker Set', 'Step into elegance with this cream-toned faux-fur mini set, adorned with gold floral appliqués that shimmer with every move.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lorem-ipsum-40', '', '', '2026-02-10 20:48:53', '2026-02-10 20:48:53', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?post_type=product&#038;p=139', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(140, 1, '2025-10-16 18:08:36', '2025-10-16 18:08:36', 'Rich chocolate faux-fur meets opulent gold in this powerful runway-ready look. A high-neck silhouette is layered with cascading golden chains and statement jewelry accents, embodying strength and luxury. The mini skirt is finished with a bold embroidered appliqué and layered chain belt for a commanding presence. Designed for leaders and icons, this set transforms tradition into modern majesty.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Care: Spot clean gently with damp cloth. Dry clean recommended to preserve chainwork and appliqué.</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Golden Dynasty', 'Rich chocolate faux-fur meets opulent gold in this powerful runway-ready look. A high-neck silhouette is layered with cascading golden chains and statement jewelry accents, embodying strength and luxury.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lorem-ipsum-41', '', '', '2026-02-10 20:49:46', '2026-02-10 20:49:46', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?post_type=product&#038;p=140', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(141, 1, '2025-10-16 18:08:36', '2025-10-16 18:08:36', 'Pretty in pink, this faux-fur mini set is all about playful femininity. The bubblegum hue is paired with sheer mesh sleeves that add a touch of romance, while pearl draping at the waist creates soft elegance. Accented with fluffy heart and bow appliqués, plus a matching faux-fur heart purse with pearl strap, this look is a pastel dream made for editorial spreads, Valentine showcases, or statement streetwear moments.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Care: Hand wash cold, lay flat to dry. Do not bleach. Professional dry clean recommended for longevity.</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Candyfloss Charm', 'Pretty in pink, this faux-fur mini set is all about playful femininity. The bubblegum hue is paired with sheer mesh sleeves that add a touch of romance, while pearl draping at the waist creates soft elegance. Accented with fluffy.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lorem-ipsum-42', '', '', '2026-02-10 20:50:46', '2026-02-10 20:50:46', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?post_type=product&#038;p=141', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(142, 1, '2025-10-16 18:08:36', '2025-10-16 18:08:36', 'A cosmic vision in black, the Starlight Noir is the ultimate statement of power and poise. This faux-fur two-piece features a fitted mini skirt and cropped vest, both accented with silver chains that drape like constellations. The long-sleeve underlay sparkles with subtle rhinestone studs, while the matching beret crowned with a metallic clover makes this look equal parts Parisian chic and futuristic glam. The silver star charm detail adds the perfect finishing touch — a reminder that this look was made to shine.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Care: Professional dry clean only. Spot clean embellishments with care.</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Starlight Noir', 'A cosmic vision in black, the Starlight Noir is the ultimate statement of power and poise. This faux-fur two-piece features a fitted mini skirt and cropped vest, both accented with silver chains that drape like constellations.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lorem-ipsum-43', '', '', '2026-02-10 20:51:33', '2026-02-10 20:51:33', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?post_type=product&#038;p=142', 0, 'product', '', 0),
