(146, 1, '2025-10-16 18:08:37', '2025-10-16 18:08:37', 'A romantic twist on bold structure, this burgundy faux-fur and tulle set takes center stage with its layered ruffle neckline and silver floral appliqué accent. The voluminous bubble skirt adds playful drama, decorated with embroidered butterfly motifs that bring movement and lightness to the rich tone. This look bridges fantasy and fashion, making it a dreamy choice for both editorial features and statement soirées.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Care: Spot clean only. Professional dry clean recommended to protect appliqués and fabric layers.</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Butterfly Bloom Set', 'A romantic twist on bold structure, this burgundy faux-fur and tulle set takes center stage with its layered ruffle neckline and silver floral appliqué accent. The voluminous bubble skirt adds playful drama, decorated with embroidered butterfly motifs that bring movement and lightness to the rich tone.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lorem-ipsum-47', '', '', '2026-02-10 21:05:09', '2026-02-10 21:05:09', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?post_type=product&#038;p=146', 0, 'product', '', 0),
