(149, 1, '2025-10-16 18:08:37', '2025-10-16 18:08:37', 'A micro-length metallic floral sheath dress drenched in glimmer and draped in drama. The multi-tonal floral sequins explode in violets, magentas, and silver on a stretch velvet base, while bold sculptural tulle ruffles crown the shoulders and wrists like couture armor. A black organza rosette blooms at the hip, finishing the look with runway intensity.\r\n\r\n<strong>Details:</strong>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Care: Dry clean only</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Midnight Bloom', 'A micro-length metallic floral sheath dress drenched in glimmer and draped in drama. The multi-tonal floral sequins explode in violets, magentas, and silver on a stretch velvet base, while bold sculptural tulle ruffles crown the shoulders and wrists like couture armor.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lorem-ipsum-50', '', '', '2026-02-10 20:09:54', '2026-02-10 20:09:54', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?post_type=product&#038;p=149', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(151, 1, '2025-10-16 18:08:37', '2025-10-16 18:08:37', '<span class=\"a_GcMg font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\">This structured cotton-poplin mini is a floral fantasy in motion. Featuring dimensional hand-sculpted rosettes that frame the neckline and a romantic floral appliqué belt detail, the look is effortlessly flirty yet powerfully feminine. Paired with a soft blush satin drape for added elegance, it’s perfect for cocktail affairs, upscale luncheons, or red carpet debuts with a playful twist.</span>', 'Rose in Bloom', '<span class=\"a_GcMg font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\">Perfect for cocktail affairs, upscale luncheons, or red carpet debuts with a playful twist.</span>', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lorem-ipsum-52', '', '', '2026-02-10 20:00:22', '2026-02-10 20:00:22', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?post_type=product&#038;p=151', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(153, 1, '2025-10-16 18:08:37', '2025-10-16 18:08:37', 'Turn heads and own the room in this electric fuchsia gown designed to radiate confidence. Crafted from a rich velvet-touch stretch fabric, the Hot Shot Halter Gown features an eye-catching cascade of floral appliqués blooming across the bodice, accented with gold beadwork for a fiery finish. The halter neckline gives way to an elegant crossback, balancing structure and sensuality. A sleek thigh-high slit adds drama and movement to this commanding silhouette.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Care Instructions: Dry clean only</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Hot Shot Halter Gown', 'T<span class=\"a_GcMg font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\">urn heads and own the room in this electric fuchsia gown designed to radiate confidence. </span>', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lorem-ipsum-54', '', '', '2026-02-10 20:15:25', '2026-02-10 20:15:25', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?post_type=product&#038;p=153', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(154, 1, '2025-10-16 18:08:37', '2025-10-16 18:08:37', '<p class=\"cvGsUA direction-ltr align-justify para-style-body\"><span class=\"a_GcMg font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\">A radiant burst of color and texture, this neon citrus mini is crafted for the bold and the beautiful. Iridescent sequin fabric forms the structured base, while cascading layers of lime tulle and an oversized sculptural flower add playful drama and haute couture flair. Finished with mesh drapes and a matching lace choker, this look is pure sunshine with a wink of rebellion.</span></p>', 'Citrus Bloom Mini', '<strong>Lorem Ipsum</strong> is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lorem-ipsum-55', '', '', '2026-02-10 20:12:07', '2026-02-10 20:12:07', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?post_type=product&#038;p=154', 0, 'product', '', 0),
