(156, 1, '2025-10-16 18:08:37', '2025-10-16 18:08:37', 'The Noir Bubble Cocktail is a statement dress that embodies vintage Parisian mourning with a modern twist. Crafted in sculpted matte satin, this one-piece cocktail silhouette features an exaggerated bubble skirt and structured bodice, cinched at the waist for dramatic impact. A bold rosette with gold stud accents sits at the hip, while a trailing veil of sheer black tulle falls from one shoulder for a theatrical finish.\r\n\r\nFabric: Matte satin, crinoline structure, gold stud detailing, tulle overlay\r\nCare Instructions: Dry clean only', 'Noir Bubble Cocktail', 'The Noir Bubble Cocktail is a statement dress that embodies vintage Parisian mourning with a modern twist. Crafted in sculpted matte satin, this one-piece cocktail silhouette features an exaggerated bubble skirt and structured bodice, cinched at the waist for dramatic impact.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lorem-ipsum-57', '', '', '2026-02-10 20:17:03', '2026-02-10 20:17:03', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?post_type=product&#038;p=156', 0, 'product', '', 0),
