(188, 1, '2025-10-16 18:08:55', '2025-10-16 18:08:55', 'This two-piece set combines a sculpted corset-style top with a voluminous tulle mesh tutu mini skirt. The structured corset features delicate rosette and pearl-like appliqués across the bodice for added drama, while the matching tutu creates a playful, ballerina-inspired silhouette. Finished with a coordinating mesh collar, this look fuses whimsical fantasy with couture craftsmanship. Designed in non-stretch polyester/elastane for a tailored fit, it’s made for moments that demand attention.', 'Dollhouse Charm', 'This two-piece set combines a sculpted corset-style top with a voluminous tulle mesh tutu mini skirt. The structured corset features delicate rosette and pearl-like appliqués across the bodice for added drama, while the matching tutu creates a playful, ballerina-inspired silhouette.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lorem-ipsum-59', '', '', '2026-02-10 20:19:23', '2026-02-10 20:19:23', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?post_type=product&#038;p=188', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(189, 1, '2025-10-16 18:08:55', '2025-10-16 18:08:55', 'This two-piece set in baby blue polyester stretch fabric pairs a sheer tie-front blouse with a high-waisted ruffle slit skirt. The blouse features soft balloon sleeves and oversized rosette appliqués, creating a romantic yet playful silhouette. The skirt’s cascading ruffle trim adds fluid movement, while the light-stretch construction ensures comfort and ease of wear. Designed without zippers or buttons, this effortless look blends feminine softness with modern versatility — perfect for evening elegance or daytime chic.', 'Azure Spell', 'This two-piece set in baby blue polyester stretch fabric pairs a sheer tie-front blouse with a high-waisted ruffle slit skirt. The blouse features soft balloon sleeves and oversized rosette appliqués, creating a romantic yet playful silhouette.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lorem-ipsum-60', '', '', '2026-02-10 19:46:53', '2026-02-10 19:46:53', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?post_type=product&#038;p=189', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(190, 1, '2025-10-16 18:08:55', '2025-10-16 18:08:55', 'This two-piece set blends whimsical softness with couture detail. The cropped cotton top is adorned with delicate floral appliqués, paired with a voluminous ruffle mesh puff skirt that moves with airy elegance. Designed in lightweight materials for comfort and statement style, this look is a modern-day fairytale moment. Perfect for editorial shoots, red carpet entrances, or any occasion where romance meets high fashion.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Care: Dry clean only to preserve appliqués and mesh ruffles</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Wildflower Waltz', 'This two-piece set blends whimsical softness with couture detail. The cropped cotton top is adorned with delicate floral appliqués, paired with a voluminous ruffle mesh puff skirt that moves with airy elegance.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lorem-ipsum-61', '', '', '2026-02-10 19:52:50', '2026-02-10 19:52:50', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?post_type=product&#038;p=190', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(191, 1, '2025-10-16 18:08:55', '2025-10-16 18:08:55', '<span class=\"a_GcMg font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\">This hot pink statement dress stuns with exaggerated ruffle details and a cascading tiered high-low skirt. The fitted bodice features a bold appliqué flower design accented with pearls, balanced by voluminous ruffle shoulders for couture-level drama. Crafted in polyester with no stretch, the silhouette holds its shape while delivering maximum movement and flair. Designed for standout moments, this “long ass dress” is playful, fearless, and unforgettable.</span>', 'Petal Fantasy', '<strong>Lorem Ipsum</strong> is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lorem-ipsum-62', '', '', '2026-02-10 20:03:45', '2026-02-10 20:03:45', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?post_type=product&#038;p=191', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(192, 1, '2025-10-16 18:08:55', '2025-10-16 18:08:55', 'This two-piece set shines in metallic silver, pairing a structured corset-inspired top with a fitted mini skirt. The top features floral appliqué detailing across the bodice with a sculpted fit and a narrower back closure for a sleek finish. The matching skirt carries coordinating embellishment for a seamless look. Complete with matching silver cottonstretch gloves, this ensemble delivers high-shine drama and elegance with every movement. Designed in polyester/elastane with light stretch for comfort and form.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Care: Spot clean or professional dry clean only to preserve metallic finish and embellishment. Gloves may be hand washed separately.</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Starlight Siren', 'This two-piece set shines in metallic silver, pairing a structured corset-inspired top with a fitted mini skirt. The top features floral appliqué detailing across the bodice with a sculpted fit and a narrower back closure for a sleek finish. The matching skirt carries coordinating embellishment for a seamless look.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lorem-ipsum-63', '', '', '2026-02-10 20:01:55', '2026-02-10 20:01:55', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?post_type=product&#038;p=192', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(193, 1, '2025-10-16 18:08:55', '2025-10-16 18:08:55', 'This violet dress is a showstopping blend of sheer allure and couture detail. Crafted in cotton and mesh, the fitted long-sleeve bodice is semi-sheer with hand-applied floral appliqués that frame the neckline and chest. A voluminous ruffle mesh skirt flows from the waist, tied together with a lustrous silk ribbon belt for a dramatic, feminine finish. Bold yet elegant, this piece is designed for the runway, red carpet, or any unforgettable occasion.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Care: Dry clean only to preserve appliqué, silk belt, and layered mesh volume</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Amethyst Enchantress', 'This violet dress is a showstopping blend of sheer allure and couture detail. Crafted in cotton and mesh, the fitted long-sleeve bodice is semi-sheer with hand-applied floral appliqués that frame the neckline and chest.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lorem-ipsum-64', '', '', '2026-02-10 21:02:19', '2026-02-10 21:02:19', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?post_type=product&#038;p=193', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(194, 1, '2025-10-16 18:08:55', '2025-10-16 18:08:55', 'This two-piece set in a bold fuchsia cotton-satin blend pairs a ruched crop top with draped shoulders and jewel clasp detail, with a matching high-waisted ruched skirt that elongates the silhouette. The rich satin sheen and gathered construction create a figure-flattering fit that balances elegance with statement power. Perfect for cocktail nights, red carpet appearances, or making an unforgettable entrance.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Care: Light machine wash or tumble dry low (no heat). Recommended delicate wash to preserve sheen and</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Fuchsia Flame Sorcery', 'This two-piece set in a bold fuchsia cotton-satin blend pairs a ruched crop top with draped shoulders and jewel clasp detail, with a matching high-waisted ruched skirt that elongates the silhouette.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lorem-ipsum-65', '', '', '2026-02-10 19:51:49', '2026-02-10 19:51:49', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?post_type=product&#038;p=194', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(196, 1, '2025-10-16 18:08:55', '2025-10-16 18:08:55', 'This powder-blue two-piece set pairs a structured corset-style top with a sleek satin mini skirt. The corset features lace trim, boning details, and oversized floral appliqués that bring texture and dimension to the look. The coordinating satin skirt is cut in a fitted silhouette with a rosette accent at the hem for a flirty finish. Designed in non-stretch satin for a sculpted fit, this set is equal parts romantic and bold — perfect for cocktail nights or editorial styling.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Care: Professional dry clean only to preserve satin finish and floral detailing.</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Bluebell Bella', 'This powder-blue two-piece set pairs a structured corset-style top with a sleek satin mini skirt. The corset features lace trim, boning details, and oversized floral appliqués that bring texture and dimension to the look.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lorem-ipsum-67', '', '', '2026-02-10 19:44:53', '2026-02-10 19:44:53', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?post_type=product&#038;p=196', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(197, 1, '2025-10-16 18:08:55', '2025-10-16 18:08:55', 'This lilac two-piece set elevates the corset-and-tulle silhouette with added drama. The structured corset top is adorned with oversized rosette appliqués and delicate embellishments, paired with sheer frill mesh long sleeves for extra texture. The layered asymmetrical tulle skirt cascades with volume and movement, blending romance and couture edge. Designed in non-stretch polyester/elastane, the tailored fit creates a regal, statement-making look fit for the runway or red carpet.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Care: Dry clean only to preserve embellishments and layered tulle structure.</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Mystic Orchid', 'This lilac two-piece set elevates the corset-and-tulle silhouette with added drama. The structured corset top is adorned with oversized rosette appliqués and delicate embellishments, paired with sheer frill mesh long sleeves for extra texture.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lorem-ipsum-68', '', '', '2026-02-10 20:08:00', '2026-02-10 20:08:00', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?post_type=product&#038;p=197', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(198, 1, '2025-10-16 18:08:55', '2025-10-16 18:08:55', 'The Swan Fantasy Bridal Dress evokes elegance, illusion, and drama. Featuring a bone-structured brocade corset in pearl white, this look is adorned with hand-placed white feathers that cascade from bustline to hem. The feathered miniskirt is layered over a soft lace base, cinched with a velvet waistband and crowned by a 3D butterfly accent.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Includes: Corset, feather skirt, detachable cage hoop overlay</li>\r\n 	<li>Care Instructions: Spot clean only, avoid water exposure on feathers</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Swan Fantasy Bridal Dress', 'The Swan Fantasy Bridal Dress evokes elegance, illusion, and drama. Featuring a bone-structured brocade corset in pearl white, this look is adorned with hand-placed white feathers that cascade from bustline to hem.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lorem-ipsum-69', '', '', '2026-02-10 20:21:57', '2026-02-10 20:21:57', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?post_type=product&#038;p=198', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(199, 1, '2025-10-16 18:08:55', '2025-10-16 18:08:55', 'This flirty, floral mini channels the golden hour in fabric form. The sequined zig-zag base mimics sunset horizons, layered with blooming appliqués and a dramatic oversized rose at the bodice. Soft mesh gloves add a dreamy finishing touch, detailed with delicate butterflies for a whisper of whimsy. This piece balances playful and polished, perfect for spring soirées or editorial statements.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Full Set Total (Dress + Gloves)</li>\r\n 	<li>Care Instructions: Dry clean only. Store gloves flat to preserve detail.</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Sunset Garden Mini', 'This flirty, floral mini channels the golden hour in fabric form. The sequined zig-zag base mimics sunset horizons, layered with blooming appliqués and a dramatic oversized rose at the bodice.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lorem-ipsum-70', '', '', '2025-11-06 21:42:19', '2025-11-06 21:42:19', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?post_type=product&#038;p=199', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(200, 1, '2025-10-16 18:08:55', '2025-10-16 18:08:55', 'Soft, seductive, and daringly delicate. This two-piece set features a satin corset-style crop top adorned with pearl lined seams and oversized 3D floral appliqués at the bust—flirty yet structured. The high-waisted mini shorts steal the spotlight with tiered petal appliqués, hand-trimmed texture, and cascading pearl draping that dances with every step. A soft-glam fantasy rooted in couture craftsmanship.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Care Instructions: Dry clean only. Handle pearls with care.</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Petal & Pearl Set', 'Soft, seductive, and daringly delicate. This two-piece set features a satin corset-style crop top adorned with pearl lined seams and oversized 3D floral appliqués at the bust—flirty yet structured.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lorem-ipsum-71', '', '', '2025-11-06 22:42:48', '2025-11-06 22:42:48', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?post_type=product&#038;p=200', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(201, 1, '2025-10-16 18:08:55', '2025-10-16 18:08:55', 'A sultry twist on sweet, this deep fuchsia cap stuns with shimmering berry embellishments, high-gloss florals, and luxe bronze-toned leaves. Its velvety texture and wine-colored accents bring a moody sophistication to your accessory game. Think garden fairy meets runway diva—perfect for photoshoots, fashion showcases, or a signature streetwear slay.', 'Berry Bombshell Cap', 'A sultry twist on sweet, this deep fuchsia cap stuns with shimmering berry embellishments, high-gloss florals, and luxe bronze-toned leaves. Its velvety texture and wine-colored accents bring a moody sophistication to your accessory game. Think garden fairy meets runway diva—perfect for photoshoots, fashion showcases, or a signature streetwear slay.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lorem-ipsum-72', '', '', '2026-02-10 20:26:01', '2026-02-10 20:26:01', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?post_type=product&#038;p=201', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(202, 1, '2025-10-16 18:08:55', '2025-10-16 18:08:55', 'A maximalist masterpiece, this ivory cap is an explosion of electric jungle magic. Decked in hot pink, teal, and violet plumes, with glittering silver zebra butterfly wings and sequin vines, this cap is a wearable fever dream. Whether it’s a high-fashion photoshoot or a showstopping performance, this one-of-a-kind creation commands the room.', 'Electric Jungle Fantasy Cap', 'A maximalist masterpiece, this ivory cap is an explosion of electric jungle magic. Decked in hot pink, teal, and violet plumes, with glittering silver zebra butterfly wings and sequin vines, this cap is a wearable fever dream.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lorem-ipsum-73', '', '', '2026-02-10 20:24:51', '2026-02-10 20:24:51', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?post_type=product&#038;p=202', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(205, 1, '2025-10-16 18:08:56', '2025-10-16 18:08:56', 'This vivid pink cap is a floral fantasy come to life. Embellished with layered appliqué petals, shimmering sequin leaves, and lime-hued feathers, it’s giving garden goddess meets carnival couture. A bold piece meant for expressive spirits, this accessory is perfect for spring editorials, music festivals, or a fearless everyday slay', 'Botanic Bloom Feather Cap', 'This vivid pink cap is a floral fantasy come to life. Embellished with layered appliqué petals, shimmering sequin leaves, and lime-hued feathers, it’s giving garden goddess meets carnival couture.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lorem-ipsum-76', '', '', '2026-02-10 20:27:44', '2026-02-10 20:27:44', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?post_type=product&#038;p=205', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(206, 1, '2025-10-16 18:08:56', '2025-10-16 18:08:56', 'Streetwear meets soft romance in this reimagined denim cap. Featuring a gradient arrangement of hand-cut rosettes in varying denim washes—ranging from deep indigo to powder blue—this hat brings a chic twist to casual. Whether paired with a denim-on-denim ensemble or used to offset a sleek look, it’s the kind of accessory that turns heads while keeping the sun out of your eyes.', 'Denim Rosette Baseball Cap', 'Streetwear meets soft romance in this reimagined denim cap. Featuring a gradient arrangement of hand-cut rosettes in varying denim washes—ranging from deep indigo to powder blue—this hat brings a chic twist to casual.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lorem-ipsum-77', '', '', '2026-02-10 20:26:33', '2026-02-10 20:26:33', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?post_type=product&#038;p=206', 0, 'product', '', 0),
