(209, 1, '2025-10-16 18:08:56', '2025-10-16 18:08:56', 'A heart-shaped drop with a twist — each one holds a bold lipstick bullet in the center. Equal parts sweet and savage, these are for the ones who kiss with color and speak with style.', 'Lip Locked Earrings', 'A heart-shaped drop with a twist — each one holds a bold lipstick bullet in the center. Equal parts sweet and savage, these are for the ones who kiss with color and speak with style.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lorem-ipsum-80', '', '', '2025-10-23 23:05:54', '2025-10-23 23:05:54', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?post_type=product&#038;p=209', 0, 'product', '', 0),
