(213, 1, '2025-10-16 18:08:56', '2025-10-16 18:08:56', 'Serving unapologetic doll-core energy, these hot-pink rectangle frames are decked out with Barbie-inspired charms: a cameo portrait, starbursts, heels, lips, and even a mini blow dryer. Fun, campy, and instantly nostalgic, they’re the ultimate playful accessory for collectors and fashion rebels alike.', 'Barbie Dream Frames', 'Serving unapologetic doll-core energy, these hot-pink rectangle frames are decked out with Barbie-inspired charms: a cameo portrait, starbursts, heels, lips, and even a mini blow dryer. Fun, campy, and instantly nostalgic, they’re the ultimate playful accessory for collectors and fashion rebels alike.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lorem-ipsum-84', '', '', '2026-02-10 19:42:40', '2026-02-10 19:42:40', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?post_type=product&#038;p=213', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(214, 1, '2025-10-16 18:08:56', '2025-10-16 18:08:56', 'Serving rhinestone realness with a side of coquette attitude, Miss Perfect is a flirty fusion of glamour and sweetness. These angular, cat-eye inspired shades feature gold frames dripping in dazzling rhinestones, edged with pink bead accents, and finished with a tiny satin bow and pink kitty charm. For the girlies who like their fashion with a wink and sparkle.', 'Miss Perfect Frames', 'Serving rhinestone realness with a side of coquette attitude, Miss Perfect is a flirty fusion of glamour and sweetness.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lorem-ipsum-85', '', '', '2026-02-10 20:23:34', '2026-02-10 20:23:34', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?post_type=product&#038;p=214', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(215, 1, '2025-10-16 18:08:56', '2025-10-16 18:08:56', 'Dripping in mermaid-core fantasy, these iridescent heart-shaped frames sparkle with seashell appliqués, rhinestone crusting, and pearlized details. Cascading chains with lavender heart charms complete the undersea siren effect, while a golden center medallion ties it all together. The perfect showstopper for festivals, editorials, or anyone channeling oceanic royalty.', 'Siren’s Treasure Shades', 'Dripping in mermaid-core fantasy, these iridescent heart-shaped frames sparkle with seashell appliqués, rhinestone crusting, and pearlized details. Cascading chains with lavender heart charms complete the undersea siren effect.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lorem-ipsum-86', '', '', '2026-02-10 19:42:24', '2026-02-10 19:42:24', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?post_type=product&#038;p=215', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(216, 1, '2025-10-16 18:08:56', '2025-10-16 18:08:56', 'Feminine with a sparkle that speaks volumes, Rose Quartz Kisses brings a vintage silhouette to life with glimmering rose gold glitter and delicate felt rosebuds. These pink-tinted cat-eye frames are perfect for brunch dates, garden parties, or just channeling your inner flirt.', 'Rose Quartz Kisses', 'Feminine with a sparkle that speaks volumes, Rose Quartz Kisses brings a vintage silhouette to life with glimmering rose gold glitter and delicate felt rosebuds. These pink-tinted cat-eye frames are perfect for brunch dates, garden parties, or just channeling your inner flirt.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lorem-ipsum-87', '', '', '2026-02-10 19:43:02', '2026-02-10 19:43:02', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?post_type=product&#038;p=216', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(217, 1, '2025-10-16 18:08:56', '2025-10-16 18:08:56', 'For the diva that doesn’t whisper—she enters with feathers and flair. Showgirl Smoke is a bold, burlesque-inspired pair of shades featuring square black frames drenched in shimmering gold and onyx rhinestones. One corner is dramatically topped with a plume of dark feathers and finished with a glitzy gold applique flower. Equal parts Moulin Rouge and Met Gala.', 'Showgirl Smoke', 'For the diva that doesn’t whisper—she enters with feathers and flair. Showgirl Smoke is a bold, burlesque-inspired pair of shades featuring square black frames drenched in shimmering gold and onyx rhinestones.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lorem-ipsum-88', '', '', '2026-02-10 20:22:53', '2026-02-10 20:22:53', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?post_type=product&#038;p=217', 0, 'product', '', 0),
