(246, 1, '2025-10-16 18:09:09', '2025-10-16 18:09:09', 'Pink crystal-studded cat-eye frames dripping in soft-girl glam. Blush satin bows, flower blossoms, pearls, and seashell accents crown the edges for a dreamy, mermaid-core finish.', 'Love Drip Frames', 'Pink crystal-studded cat-eye frames dripping in soft-girl glam. Blush satin bows, flower blossoms, pearls, and seashell accents crown the edges for a dreamy, mermaid-core finish.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lorem-ipsum-89', '', '', '2026-02-10 19:42:07', '2026-02-10 19:42:07', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?post_type=product&#038;p=246', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(247, 1, '2025-10-16 18:09:09', '2025-10-16 18:09:09', 'Draped in rich purple tones and pearl accents, the Amethyst Garden Frames embody elegance with a romantic twist. Heart-shaped burgundy lenses are bordered with tiny pearls, while clusters of violet blossoms bloom across the corners. A detachable pearl chain with heart charms adds drama, making them both eyewear and jewelry in one statement piece.', 'Amethyst Garden Frames', 'Draped in rich purple tones and pearl accents, the Amethyst Garden Frames embody elegance with a romantic twist. Heart-shaped burgundy lenses are bordered with tiny pearls, while clusters of violet blossoms bloom across the corners.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lorem-ipsum-90', '', '', '2026-02-10 19:41:07', '2026-02-10 19:41:07', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?post_type=product&#038;p=247', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(248, 1, '2025-10-16 18:09:09', '2025-10-16 18:09:09', 'Channeling royal garden glamour, the Regal Bloom Frames blend jet-black heart lenses with jewel-toned florals and gemstone appliqués. Bold ruby, sapphire, and emerald accents line the edges, while golden floral details add a regal finish. These sunnies radiate opulence, perfect for runways, red carpets, or any queen making her entrance', 'Regal Bloom Frames', 'Channeling royal garden glamour, the Regal Bloom Frames blend jet-black heart lenses with jewel-toned florals and gemstone appliqués. Bold ruby, sapphire, and emerald accents line the edges, while golden floral details add a regal finish. These sunnies radiate opulence, perfect for runways, red carpets, or any queen making her entrance', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lorem-ipsum-91', '', '', '2026-02-10 19:40:09', '2026-02-10 19:40:09', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?post_type=product&#038;p=248', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(249, 1, '2025-10-16 18:09:09', '2025-10-16 18:09:09', 'Step into a sugar-coated fantasy with Candyland Crush. These heart-shaped frames are dipped in pastel pearls, mini donut charms, spiral lollipops, and candy cabochons. They’re a full-on dessert party for your face — playful, bold, and unapologetically sweet.', 'Candyland Crush Frames', 'Step into a sugar-coated fantasy with Candyland Crush. These heart-shaped frames are dipped in pastel pearls, mini donut charms, spiral lollipops, and candy cabochons. They’re a full-on dessert party for your face — playful, bold, and unapologetically sweet.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lorem-ipsum-92', '', '', '2026-02-10 19:41:47', '2026-02-10 19:41:47', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?post_type=product&#038;p=249', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(250, 1, '2025-10-16 18:09:09', '2025-10-16 18:09:09', 'If Elle Woods and a Bratz doll had a sunglasses baby — this would be it. These sharp cat-eye frames feature ombré pink lenses trimmed in sparkling rhinestones, lined with pastel gems, and crowned with a baby pink bow charm on the corner for that wink of girly drama.', 'Pinkie Promise Rhinestone Frames', 'If Elle Woods and a Bratz doll had a sunglasses baby — this would be it. These sharp cat-eye frames feature ombré pink lenses trimmed in sparkling rhinestones, lined with pastel gems.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lorem-ipsum-93', '', '', '2026-02-10 19:41:29', '2026-02-10 19:41:29', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?post_type=product&#038;p=250', 0, 'product', '', 0),
(251, 1, '2025-10-16 18:09:09', '2025-10-16 18:09:09', 'These hot-pink heart frames are crowned with oversized iridescent jewels in rainbow hues, catching light from every angle. Bold yet playful, they’re made for festival season, glam photoshoots, or anytime you want to shine unapologetically.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Care: Spot clean gently; store in protective pouch to prevent scratching</li>\r\n</ul>', 'Prism Heart Frames', 'These hot-pink heart frames are crowned with oversized iridescent jewels in rainbow hues, catching light from every angle. Bold yet playful, they’re made for festival season, glam photoshoots, or anytime you want to shine unapologetically.', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'lorem-ipsum-94', '', '', '2026-02-10 19:40:49', '2026-02-10 19:40:49', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?post_type=product&#038;p=251', 0, 'product', '', 0),
