		</a>\n									<h2>Summer</h2>							\n				<p>Leopard Luxe: “Untamed. Unmatched. Unapologetic.”</p>								<a href=\"#\">\n									View More\n					</a>\n																			<img width=\"600\" height=\"800\" src=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-Leto-Leopard-Home-Page-.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-Leto-Leopard-Home-Page-.jpg 600w, https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-Leto-Leopard-Home-Page--225x300.jpg 225w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" />																										<img width=\"600\" height=\"800\" src=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-Leto-Denim-Home-Page-.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-Leto-Denim-Home-Page-.jpg 600w, https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-Leto-Denim-Home-Page--225x300.jpg 225w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" />																<h2>Couture</h2>							\n				<p>Denim Couture: “From rugged to regal. This isn’t your average denim.”</p>								<a href=\"#\">\n									View More\n					</a>\n									<h2>Red Carpet Ready</h2>							\n				<p>Leopard Luxe: “Untamed. Unmatched. Unapologetic.”</p>								<a href=\"#\">\n									View More\n					</a>\n																			<img width=\"600\" height=\"800\" src=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-Leto-Leopard-Home-Page-.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-Leto-Leopard-Home-Page-.jpg 600w, https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-Leto-Leopard-Home-Page--225x300.jpg 225w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" />																										<img width=\"600\" height=\"800\" src=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-Leto-Accessories-Home-Page.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-Leto-Accessories-Home-Page.jpg 600w, https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-Leto-Accessories-Home-Page-225x300.jpg 225w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" />																<h2>Accessories</h2>							\n				<p>Accessories: “Even your sunglasses deserve a standing ovation.”</p>								<a href=\"#\">\n									View More\n					</a>\n																			<img width=\"600\" height=\"800\" src=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-Leto-Custom-Designs-Home-Page-.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-Leto-Custom-Designs-Home-Page-.jpg 600w, https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-Leto-Custom-Designs-Home-Page--225x300.jpg 225w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" />																<h2>Custom Orders\n</h2>							\n				<p>Have an idea for something extraordinary?<br />Let’s collaborate to create a custom piece made<br />just for you – crafted with care, passion, and attention to detail.</p>								<a href=\"#\">\n									View More\n					</a>\n									<h2>Shop The Collections\n</h2>							\n				<p>Discover our signature collections, crafted with precision and artistry. <br />From everyday statements to couture moments, find what speaks to you.</p>			<h2>Summer line\n</h2>					<h2>Get 20% Off</h2>										<a href=\"#\">\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M256 8c137 0 248 111 248 248S393 504 256 504 8 393 8 256 119 8 256 8zM140 300h116v70.9c0 10.7 13 16.1 20.5 8.5l114.3-114.9c4.7-4.7 4.7-12.2 0-16.9l-114.3-115c-7.6-7.6-20.5-2.2-20.5 8.5V212H140c-6.6 0-12 5.4-12 12v64c0 6.6 5.4 12 12 12z\"></path></svg>			\n									Shop Now\n					</a>\n									<h2>Fall Line</h2>					<h2>Sneak Peek</h2>										<a href=\"#\">\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M256 8c137 0 248 111 248 248S393 504 256 504 8 393 8 256 119 8 256 8zM140 300h116v70.9c0 10.7 13 16.1 20.5 8.5l114.3-114.9c4.7-4.7 4.7-12.2 0-16.9l-114.3-115c-7.6-7.6-20.5-2.2-20.5 8.5V212H140c-6.6 0-12 5.4-12 12v64c0 6.6 5.4 12 12 12z\"></path></svg>			\n									Take A Look\n					</a>\n						<h2>Denim</h2>							\n						<h2>Leopard</h2>							\n						<h2>Accessories</h2>							\n						<h2>Custom Designs</h2>										<a href=\"#\">\n									Shop Now\n					</a>\n									<h2>Latest News\n</h2>							\n				<p>Stay inspired with updates on our newest releases, press highlights, and creative projects. From new collections to exclusive features, explore what’s making headlines in our fashion journey.</p>					\n						<h2>Leopard</h2>							\n						<h2>Accessories</h2>							\n						<h2>Custom Designs</h2>										<a href=\"#\">\n									Shop Now\n					</a>\n									<h2>Join Our Newsletter\n</h2>															<img width=\"600\" height=\"800\" src=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-Leto-opt-in-Home-Page-1.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-Leto-opt-in-Home-Page-1.png 600w, https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-Leto-opt-in-Home-Page-1-225x300.png 225w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" />', 'Home', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '264-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-10-16 23:04:04', '2025-10-16 23:04:04', '', 264, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?p=361', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
