-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"50px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">ORGANIZE YOUR TRAVEL </h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>f you plan to do lots of different types of activities on your vacation, you’ll have a fair amount of gear you need to pack into your suitcase. Keeping everything organized can be a challenge. One of the best things you can do when you\'re packing for any trip—especially one that requires packing lots of layers—is to use&nbsp;packing organizers.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":38,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://checkyourproject.website/mockup/amberleto/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/blog-post-img-1024x682.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-38\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"50px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>BASIC CLOTHING PACKING LIST:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Passport</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Phone charger / portable phone charger</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Euros</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>EU adapters</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Flip flops (for the hostel bathrooms)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Water bottle</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Socks</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Underwear</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Sun cream</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Medicines / painkillers</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Any paperwork you may need</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer -->\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":5} -->\n<h5 class=\"wp-block-heading\">GET MORE PACKING ADVICE!</h5>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Want to learn more about how to pack for a specific type of trip? We’ve got more packing advice from travel experts here</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":39,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://checkyourproject.website/mockup/amberleto/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/blog-post-img3-1024x682.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-39\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->', 'Sommer\'s top 10 winter products for men', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '378-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-10-16 23:53:11', '2025-10-16 23:53:11', '', 378, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?p=379', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(380, 1, '2025-10-16 23:53:45', '2025-10-16 23:53:45', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This is it—18 days until fashion history unfolds. On <em>Black Friday week</em>, in the heart of <em>Manhattan</em>, <strong>Amber Leto Designs</strong> <strong>inc</strong> opens the doors to something bold, intimate, and utterly unmissable: the first ever showroom pop-up where her full 2025 collection drops for purchase, in person, for one spectacular week only.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":1168,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://amberleto.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Photo-Aug-29-2025-9-14-49-PM-6-834x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1168\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Imagine stepping into a world where cutting-edge design meets elevated femininity—where structured cage silhouettes, feather-soft drapes, and power-play tailoring collide. This is the collection you’ve seen in lookbooks and whispers; this is the moment you touch it, try it, and claim it.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">CHOOSE THE RIGHT TRAVEL BAG FOR YOUR TRIP</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":1169,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://amberleto.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Photo-Aug-29-2025-9-14-49-PM-2-1024x824.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1169\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>It’s the <em>launch</em> of Amber’s brand-new 2025 line—this is her first showroom experience ever.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>It’s <em>live-and-in-person</em> in New York, so you’re not just shopping online—you’re stepping into the design studio, feeling the fabric, meeting the energy.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>It’s <em>exclusive</em>, with limited quantities and early-access perks for visitors.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>It’s tied to the Black Friday momentum—so expect surprises: drop-ins, styling sessions, maybe a few one-of-a-kind pieces you won’t find again</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">WHAT TO EXPECT:</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When you arrive, the space is transformed into her design realm: movement-forward lighting, curated racks of dresses, suits, separates—all 2025 pieces. Think “Mad About Plaid” meets “Future Femme”. Think bold colors, architectural cuts, fearless details. A look from her recent “Powder Blue Cage Dress (Flamenco Fantasy Gown)” moment? That energy radiates through.<br>You’ll be greeted with glam-touched styling stations, maybe a champagne (mocktail) toast, and the kind of vibe where you know you’re discovering something before the rest of the world. Some pieces will be tagged “first come, first served”. Some looks might debut at the showroom and be gone in hours</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":1170,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://amberleto.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Photo-Aug-29-2025-9-14-49-PM-5-1024x819.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1170\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">WHY YOU NEED TO BE HERE:</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Because owning a piece of Amber’s 2025 line <em>now</em> isn’t just shopping—it’s investing. It’s saying: I was here at the beginning. I walked in when it was new. I own a piece of that launch energy. And the next time you wear it? You’ll know exactly where it came from.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Plus, the network: fellow fashion-forward women and men, influencers, media, stylists—this is where new connections spark.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>And the exclusivity: when you shop this showroom, you’re part of a select group. You’re stepping into the inner circle of Amber’s brand journey.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>The clock is ticking.</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>With just 18 days to go, the invite is live at [posh.vip link]—reserve your slot, mark your calendar, bring your A-game. Walk in ready to feel empowered, inspired, and ready to claim your standout piece from the 2025 collection.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>This isn’t just shopping—it’s a moment. And it might be <em>everything</em>.<br><br>See you in NYC. Be ready.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://posh.vip/e/amber-leto-designs-exclusive-black-friday-pop-up\" data-type=\"link\" data-id=\"https://posh.vip/e/amber-leto-designs-exclusive-black-friday-pop-up\">RSVP HERE</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"lightbox\":{\"enabled\":false},\"id\":1167,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"custom\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://amberleto.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Nov-28-Pop-Up-Market-Flyer-6-791x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1167\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Unlock the Unexpected: Amber Leto Designs’ 2025 Collections Make Their Live Debut in NYC', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', 'how-to-find-the-perfect-gift-for-anyone-on-your-list', '', '', '2025-11-11 02:49:34', '2025-11-11 02:49:34', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?p=380', 0, 'post', '', 0),
(381, 1, '2025-10-16 23:53:45', '2025-10-16 23:53:45', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Bookmark this travel packing list because you’ll want to refer to it as your trip gets closer. It’ll serve as a tool to tell you exactly what to pack, whether you’re planning an international trip, a weekend vacation, or even a long-term round the world adventure. It will help you make sure you\'ve thought of everything you might want to pack—those must-have items you need to enjoy your vacation and&nbsp;travel essentials&nbsp;that make your trip run more smoothly.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":36,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://checkyourproject.website/mockup/amberleto/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/blog-post-wide-1024x682.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-36\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Not only that, but we’ll help you choose the right travel bag, and learn how to organize it so everything perfectly fits in your bag. Below is a list of gear and clear steps to take before every trip. Look no further—we have your ultimate packing list!</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"50px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\"><strong>CHOOSE THE RIGHT TRAVEL BAG FOR YOUR TRIP</strong></h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":37,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://checkyourproject.website/mockup/amberleto/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/blog-post-img2-1024x681.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-37\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Rolling Luggage</strong>:  Wheels are nice. There’s no need to carry all your gear on your back or via a duffle bag if you know you’re going to be traveling in a city where there are paved roads and sidewalks.&nbsp;You may also want to consider a&nbsp;bag with off-road wheels, making them extra durable for trips even when there isn’t a smooth path.&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<br></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>4-Wheels</strong>: As you fill up your wheeled luggage, weight can become a bit restrictive—especially if you have to walk long distances. Consider 4-wheels to keep the weight off your wrist and effortlessly roll your bag by your side.<br></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Duffel Bag</strong>: These are simple, lightweight, and Eagle Creek’s duffel bags are crazy durable. Sling it over your shoulder, or put some wheels on it and get on your way.&nbsp;These are the most versatile travel solutions you can get, with everything from&nbsp;classic duffels&nbsp;to&nbsp;convertible backpacks,&nbsp;wheels, and more.&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;<br></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Wheeled Backpack</strong>: If you’ll be going through different types of terrain, or switching from airports to cobblestones, having a bag with the option to roll it or carry it like a backpack or duffel is really handy.<br></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Travel Backpack</strong>: If you know you don’t want the extra weight of wheels, traveling with a&nbsp;classic travel pack&nbsp;is going to mean hands-free mobility and ultimate versatility.<br></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Carry-On</strong>: Whenever possible,&nbsp;travel with carry on luggage. It means you can&nbsp;save time at the airport, save on check-in fees, guarantee the airlines won’t lose your bag, have everything you need with you at all times, ensure you don’t have to wait at baggage claim…the list goes on and on.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"50px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">ORGANIZE YOUR TRAVEL </h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>f you plan to do lots of different types of activities on your vacation, you’ll have a fair amount of gear you need to pack into your suitcase. Keeping everything organized can be a challenge. One of the best things you can do when you\'re packing for any trip—especially one that requires packing lots of layers—is to use&nbsp;packing organizers.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":38,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://checkyourproject.website/mockup/amberleto/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/blog-post-img-1024x682.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-38\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"50px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:50px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><strong>BASIC CLOTHING PACKING LIST:</strong></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Passport</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Phone charger / portable phone charger</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Euros</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>EU adapters</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Flip flops (for the hostel bathrooms)</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Water bottle</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Socks</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Underwear</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Sun cream</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Medicines / painkillers</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Any paperwork you may need</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer -->\n<div style=\"height:100px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":5} -->\n<h5 class=\"wp-block-heading\">GET MORE PACKING ADVICE!</h5>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Want to learn more about how to pack for a specific type of trip? We’ve got more packing advice from travel experts here</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":39,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://checkyourproject.website/mockup/amberleto/wp-content/uploads/2025/08/blog-post-img3-1024x682.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-39\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->', 'How to find the perfect gift for anyone on your list', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '380-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-10-16 23:53:45', '2025-10-16 23:53:45', '', 380, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?p=381', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(383, 1, '2025-10-16 23:59:23', '2025-10-16 23:59:23', '<img width=\"600\" height=\"900\" src=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Pink-Gown-Home-Page-Header.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Pink-Gown-Home-Page-Header.png 600w, https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Pink-Gown-Home-Page-Header-200x300.png 200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" />																<h2>Amber Leto <br>\nOne of a Kind Designs</h2>							\n				<p>Designed to Be the Main Character.</p><p>Step into a world where every outfit demands a spotlight. One-of-a-kind fashion for women who dare to be unforgettable.</p>								<a href=\"#\">\n									View More\n					</a>\n									<h2>About the Designer\n</h2>							\n				<p>I Don’t Just Design Clothes… I Dress Moments.</p><p>Amber Leto, a Bronx-born visionary with a heart full of glitter and grit, brings decades of theatrical flair, psychological depth, and unapologetic confidence into every stitch. With degrees in psychology and a passion for self-expression, Amber transforms fabric into fantasy — empowering women 18 to 58+ to walk through life like it’s their personal runway.</p>													<img width=\"504\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-About-page-504x1024.jpeg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-About-page-504x1024.jpeg 504w, https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-About-page-148x300.jpeg 148w, https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-About-page-600x1219.jpeg 600w, https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-About-page.jpeg 640w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 504px) 100vw, 504px\" />															