(470, 1, '2025-10-17 19:05:17', '2025-10-17 19:05:17', '<h2>About The Designer</h2>							\n				I Don’t Just Design Clothes… I Dress Moments.<p>Amber Leto, a Bronx-born visionary with a heart full of glitter and grit, brings decades of theatrical flair, psychological depth, and unapologetic confidence into every stitch.</p><p>With degrees in psychology and a passion for self-expression, Amber transforms fabric into fantasy — empowering women 18 to 58+ to walk through life like it’s their personal runway.</p><p>Amber – additional text TBD</p>\n<p>Amber – additional text TBD</p>													<img width=\"482\" height=\"888\" src=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-Leto-About-The-Designer.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-Leto-About-The-Designer.jpg 482w, https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-Leto-About-The-Designer-163x300.jpg 163w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 482px) 100vw, 482px\" />																		\n																	<img width=\"800\" height=\"1000\" src=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-Leto-Group-Shot-scaled-1-819x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-Leto-Group-Shot-scaled-1-819x1024.jpg 819w, https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-Leto-Group-Shot-scaled-1-240x300.jpg 240w, https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-Leto-Group-Shot-scaled-1-768x960.jpg 768w, https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-Leto-Group-Shot-scaled-1-1229x1536.jpg 1229w, https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-Leto-Group-Shot-scaled-1-1638x2048.jpg 1638w, https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-Leto-Group-Shot-scaled-1-600x750.jpg 600w, https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-Leto-Group-Shot-scaled-1.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" />																<h2>Where Costume Meets Couture.\n</h2>							\n				In vulputate felis vel odio porttitor lobortis. Vivamus interdum efficitur leo, quis dictum lectus. Fusce convallis risus non lectus aliquam malesuada. Vestibulum vehicula, felis ac porttitor viverra, dui ante interdum lectus, laoreet facilisis metus neque in mauris. Integer dolor mi, sagittis eget placerat sed, accumsan mollis dolor. Praesent purus sem, ultrices sit amet gravida vel, semper ut metus.\n			<h2>Timeless Silhouettes. Modern Edge. \n</h2>							\n				<p>Nulla eleifend scelerisque vulputate. Mauris lobortis a mauris eu convallis. Morbi vulputate nisi eget maximus vehicula. Vestibulum mattis consectetur ligula, id suscipit quam dapibus vel. Maecenas molestie.</p><p>Enim sit amet suscipit imperdiet, justo diam semper leo, quis finibus sapien eros et est. In hac habitasse platea dictumst. Etiam non dolor dapibus ligula mollis ornare vulputate eget elit. Maecenas bibendum placerat.</p>													<img width=\"504\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-About-page-504x1024.jpeg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-About-page-504x1024.jpeg 504w, https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-About-page-148x300.jpeg 148w, https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-About-page-600x1219.jpeg 600w, https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-About-page.jpeg 640w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 504px) 100vw, 504px\" />																<h2>Amber – TBD\n</h2>							\n				<p>Nulla eleifend scelerisque vulputate. Mauris lobortis a mauris eu convallis. Morbi vulputate nisi eget maximus vehicula. Vestibulum mattis consectetur.</p>			<h2>Stay in Touch\n</h2>					<h2>Location\n</h2>		Arizona\n			<h2>Contact\n</h2>		<p><a href=\"mailto:info@checkyourproject.website\">info@checkyourproject.website</a></p>			<h2>Hours</h2>		<p><strong>M – F : </strong>8am–5pm</p><p><strong>Sat</strong> : 11am–6pm</p><p><strong>Sun</strong> : Closed</p>', 'About the Designer', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '269-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-10-17 19:05:17', '2025-10-17 19:05:17', '', 269, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?p=470', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
