 to detail.</p>								<a href=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/custom-orders/\">\n									View More\n					</a>\n									<h2>Shop The Collections\n</h2>							\n				<p>Discover our signature collections, crafted with precision and artistry. <br />From everyday statements to couture moments, find what speaks to you.</p>			<h2>Summer line\n</h2>					<h2>Get 20% Off</h2>										<a href=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/shop-the-collection/\">\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M256 8c137 0 248 111 248 248S393 504 256 504 8 393 8 256 119 8 256 8zM140 300h116v70.9c0 10.7 13 16.1 20.5 8.5l114.3-114.9c4.7-4.7 4.7-12.2 0-16.9l-114.3-115c-7.6-7.6-20.5-2.2-20.5 8.5V212H140c-6.6 0-12 5.4-12 12v64c0 6.6 5.4 12 12 12z\"></path></svg>			\n									Shop Now\n					</a>\n									<h2>Fall Line</h2>					<h2>Sneak Peek</h2>										<a href=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/shop-the-collection/\">\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M256 8c137 0 248 111 248 248S393 504 256 504 8 393 8 256 119 8 256 8zM140 300h116v70.9c0 10.7 13 16.1 20.5 8.5l114.3-114.9c4.7-4.7 4.7-12.2 0-16.9l-114.3-115c-7.6-7.6-20.5-2.2-20.5 8.5V212H140c-6.6 0-12 5.4-12 12v64c0 6.6 5.4 12 12 12z\"></path></svg>			\n									Take A Look\n					</a>\n						<h2>Denim</h2>							\n						<h2>Leopard</h2>							\n						<h2>Accessories</h2>							\n						<h2>Custom Designs</h2>										<a href=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/shop-the-collection/\">\n									Shop Now\n					</a>\n									<h2>Latest News\n</h2>							\n				<p>Stay inspired with updates on our newest releases, press highlights, and creative projects. From new collections to exclusive features, explore what’s making headlines in our fashion journey.</p>			<h2>Join Our Newsletter\n</h2>															<img width=\"600\" height=\"800\