(477, 1, '2025-10-20 17:05:02', '2025-10-20 17:05:02', '<h2>About The Designer</h2>							\n				<p>I Don’t Just Design Clothes… I Dress Moments.</p><p>Amber Leto, a Bronx-born visionary with a heart full of glitter and grit, brings decades of theatrical flair, psychological depth, and unapologetic confidence into every stitch.</p><p>With degrees in psychology and a passion for self-expression, Amber transforms fabric into fantasy — empowering women 18 to 58+ to walk through life like it’s their personal runway.</p><p>Amber – additional text TBD</p>\n<p>Amber – additional text TBD</p>													<img width=\"482\" height=\"888\" src=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-Leto-About-The-Designer.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-Leto-About-The-Designer.jpg 482w, https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-Leto-About-The-Designer-163x300.jpg 163w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 482px) 100vw, 482px\" />																		\n																	<img width=\"800\" height=\"1000\" src=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-Leto-Group-Shot-scaled-1-819x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-Leto-Group-Shot-scaled-1-819x1024.jpg 819w, https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-Leto-Group-Shot-scaled-1-600x750.jpg 600w, https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-Leto-Group-Shot-scaled-1-240x300.jpg 240w, https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-Leto-Group-Shot-scaled-1-768x960.jpg 768w, https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-Leto-Group-Shot-scaled-1-1229x1536.jpg 1229w, https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/ambe