(484, 1, '2025-10-20 17:15:57', '2025-10-20 17:15:57', '<h2>Rentals</h2>							\n							<h2>Want to create a moment? Borrow one.\n</h2>		<p>Step into the spotlight with an Amber Leto original — even if it’s just for the night. Our exclusive rental program gives stylists, performers, and tastemakers access to one-of-a-kind couture that guarantees unforgettable entrances.</p>			<h2>How It Works</h2>					<h2>1. Inquiry Form</h2>		<p>Tell us about your event, shoot, or red carpet moment. Share the date, location, and style you’re looking for.</p>			<h2>2. Contract &amp; Approval</h2>		<p>Once your request is reviewed and approved, we’ll send you a rental agreement outlining the terms, fees, and care instructions.</p>			<h2>3. Delivery / Pickup\n</h2>		<p>Your chosen design will be shipped to you or prepared for in-person pickup. We ensure each piece is cleaned, inspected, and ready to turn heads.</p>			<h2>4. Return</h2>		<p>After your moment in the spotlight, simply return the garment in the original packaging using the provided shipping label or via arranged drop-off.</p>			<h2>Rental Policies (Optional Section)</h2>		<ul><li>All rentals are for a fixed term, with late returns subject to additional fees.</li><li>Garments must be returned in the condition received.</li><li>Repairs due to damage may incur charges; replacement fees apply for unreturned pieces.</li><li>A non-refundable deposit is required to secure the rental.</li></ul>			<h2>Call-to-Action</h2>										<a href=\"https://form.jotform.com/252436652199061\" target=\"_blank\">\n									Start Your Rental Request\n					</a>', 'Rentals', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'rentals', '', '', '2025-10-20 17:25:31', '2025-10-20 17:25:31', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?page_id=484', 0, 'page', '', 0),
