(506, 1, '2025-10-20 17:47:39', '2025-10-20 17:47:39', '<img width=\"600\" height=\"900\" src=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Pink-Gown-Home-Page-Header.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Pink-Gown-Home-Page-Header.png 600w, https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Pink-Gown-Home-Page-Header-200x300.png 200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" />																<h2>Amber Leto <br>\nOne of a Kind Designs</h2>							\n				<p>Designed to Be the Main Character.</p><p>Step into a world where every outfit demands a spotlight. One-of-a-kind fashion for women who dare to be unforgettable.</p>								<a href=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/contact-us/\">\n									View More\n					</a>\n									<h2>About the Designer\n</h2>							\n				<p>I Don’t Just Design Clothes… I Dress Moments.</p><p>Amber Leto, a Bronx-born visionary with a heart full of glitter and grit, brings decades of theatrical flair, psychological depth, and unapologetic confidence into every stitch. With degrees in psychology and a passion for self-expression, Amber transforms fabric into fantasy — empowering women 18 to 58+ to walk through life like it’s their personal runway.</p>													<img width=\"504\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-About-page-504x1024.jpeg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-About-page-504x1024.jpeg 504w, https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-About-page-600x1219.jpeg 600w, https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-About-page-148x300.jpeg 148w, https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-About-page.jpeg 6