(553, 1, '2025-10-22 22:05:34', '2025-10-22 22:05:34', '<h2>Custom Order</h2>							\n				<p>I Don’t Just Design Clothes… I Dress Moments.</p>			<h2>Let’s Talk\n</h2>							\n				<p>Each custom order is uniquely designed to reflect your personal style and event vision. Share your details below, and we’ll bring your dream look to life.</p>			<h2>Stay in Touch\n</h2>					<h2>Location\n</h2>		Arizona\n			<h2>Phone Number</h2>		<p><a href=\"tel:6199942237\">619-994-2237</a></p>			<h2>Contact\n</h2>		<p><a href=\"mailto:info@amberleto.com\">info@amberleto.com</a></p>			<h2>Hours</h2>		<p><strong>M – F : </strong>8am–5pm</p><p><strong>Sat</strong> : 11am–6pm</p><p><strong>Sun</strong> : Closed</p>', 'Custom Orders', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '272-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-10-22 22:05:34', '2025-10-22 22:05:34', '', 272, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?p=553', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(554, 1, '2026-02-10 20:21:46', '2026-02-10 20:21:46', 'The Swan Fantasy Bridal Dress evokes elegance, illusion, and drama. Featuring a bone-structured brocade corset in pearl white, this look is adorned with hand-placed white feathers that cascade from bustline to hem. The feathered miniskirt is layered over a soft lace base, cinched with a velvet waistband and crowned by a 3D butterfly accent.\n<ul>\n 	<li>Includes: Corset, feather skirt, detachable cage hoop overlay</li>\n 	<li>Care Instructions: Spot clean only, avoid water exposure on feathers</li>\n</ul>', 'Swan Fantasy Bridal Dress', 'The Swan Fantasy Cocktail Dress evokes elegance, illusion, and drama. Featuring a bone-structured brocade corset in pearl white, this look is adorned with hand-placed white feathers that cascade from bustline to hem.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '198-autosave-v1', '', '', '2026-02-10 20:21:46', '2026-02-10 20:21:46', '', 198, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?p=554', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(557, 1, '2025-10-22 22:56:46', '2025-10-22 22:56:46', 'This flirty, floral mini channels the golden hour in fabric form. The sequined zig-zag base mimics sunset horizons,\nlayered with blooming appliqués and a dramatic oversized rose at the bodice. Soft mesh gloves add a dreamy\nfinishing touch, detailed with delicate butterflies for a whisper of whimsy. This piece balances playful and polished, perfect for spring soirées or editorial statements.\n<ul>\n 	<li>Full Set Total (Dress + Gloves)</li>\n 	<li>Care Instructions: Dry clean only. Store gloves flat to preserve detail.</li>\n</ul>', 'Lorem Ipsum', '<strong>Lorem Ipsum</strong> is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '199-autosave-v1', '', '', '2025-10-22 22:56:46', '2025-10-22 22:56:46', '', 199, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?p=557', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
