(560, 1, '2025-10-22 23:02:56', '2025-10-22 23:02:56', 'Soft, seductive, and daringly delicate. This two-piece set features a satin corset-style crop top adorned with pearl lined seams and oversized 3D floral appliqués at the bust—flirty yet structured. The high-waisted mini shorts steal the spotlight with tiered petal appliqués, hand-trimmed texture, and cascading pearl draping that dances with every step. A soft-glam fantasy rooted in couture craftsmanship.', 'Lorem Ipsum', 'Soft, seductive, and daringly delicate. This two-piece set features a satin corset-style crop top adorned with pearl lined seams and oversized 3D floral appliqués at the bust—flirty yet structured.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '200-autosave-v1', '', '', '2025-10-22 23:02:56', '2025-10-22 23:02:56', '', 200, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?p=560', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
