(563, 1, '2025-10-22 23:25:01', '2025-10-22 23:25:01', 'She’s got bite and beauty. Leopard Claw is a fierce bodycon fantasy blending power, sensuality, and pure high fashion heat. Featuring a structured sweetheart bodice with sculpted cups and a full-length sheer mesh overlay, this gown hugs every curve while delivering a bold claw-marked illusion with velvet leopard appliqué. The daring thigh high slit and jet-black feather trim whisper drama with every step, while gold claw rings and accessories add that unapologetic edge.\n<ul>\n 	<li>Fit: Form-fitting with flexible bust and leg room</li>\n 	<li>Care: Dry clean only</li>\n</ul>', 'Lorem Ipsum', '<strong>Lorem Ipsum</strong> is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '68-autosave-v1', '', '', '2025-10-22 23:25:01', '2025-10-22 23:25:01', '', 68, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?p=563', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
