(569, 1, '2025-10-22 23:55:43', '2025-10-22 23:55:43', 'This layered hi-lo moment blends animal instinct with golden goddess glam. The stretch jersey top hugs in all the right places, while the cascading ruffle skirt delivers volume, texture, and a whole lot of runway magic. Finished with a leopard floral appliqué on the shoulder, it’s safari—but make it slay.', 'Lorem Ipsum', '<strong>Lorem Ipsum</strong> is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '71-autosave-v1', '', '', '2025-10-22 23:55:43', '2025-10-22 23:55:43', '', 71, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?p=569', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
