(574, 1, '2025-10-23 00:00:59', '2025-10-23 00:00:59', 'This flirty bubble-hem mini dress brings playful danger to the dance floor. With its sculpted black bodice and voluminous leopard skirt, it’s giving vintage pin-up meets jungle seductress. Oversized floral appliqués and hidden side pockets add the perfect touch of feminine drama and sass. Pair it with the matching oversized leopard wrap hat and plush mini clutch to unleash your wildest walk.\n<ul>\n 	<li>Care: Spot clean or dry clean only</li>\n</ul>', 'Lorem Ipsum', '<strong>Lorem Ipsum</strong> is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '78-autosave-v1', '', '', '2025-10-23 00:00:59', '2025-10-23 00:00:59', '', 78, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?p=574', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
