(604, 1, '2025-10-23 00:26:06', '2025-10-23 00:26:06', 'This two-piece denim set pairs a sculpted sweetheart crop top with asymmetrical high-slit denim shorts. The top features corset-style seam work and a structured fit, while the shorts offer raw frayed edges, a dual-belt illusion waistband, and a handcrafted denim flower appliqué with soft blue tulle accents. Designed to turn heads, this playful yet tailored look blends streetwear edge with couture whimsy.', 'Lorem Ipsum', '<strong>Lorem Ipsum</strong> is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '81-autosave-v1', '', '', '2025-10-23 00:26:06', '2025-10-23 00:26:06', '', 81, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?p=604', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
