(611, 1, '2025-10-23 16:35:00', '2025-10-23 16:35:00', 'Flirty, fearless, and fully denim. This bold two-piece set features a strapless button-front denim top with pocket flap accents and delicate floral appliqué. Paired with a double-ruffle tiered mini skirt in rich indigo wash, it’s the perfect mix of playful and power.\n<ul>\n 	<li>Care: Hand wash cold or dry clean</li>\n</ul>', 'Lorem Ipsum', '<strong>Lorem Ipsum</strong> is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '82-autosave-v1', '', '', '2025-10-23 16:35:00', '2025-10-23 16:35:00', '', 82, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?p=611', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
