(616, 1, '2025-10-23 16:40:00', '2025-10-23 16:40:00', 'Laid-back never looked this luxe. This dazzling two-piece look pairs comfy drawstring denim shorts with an\nembellished sleeveless top, featuring a sheer rhinestone overlay and denim underlayer. Subtle sparkle, featherlike\nappliqué, and a touch of attitude make this casual set festival- or runway-ready\n<ul>\n 	<li>Care: Hand wash cold, lay flat to dry</li>\n</ul>', 'Lorem Ipsum', '<strong>Lorem Ipsum</strong> is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '83-autosave-v1', '', '', '2025-10-23 16:40:00', '2025-10-23 16:40:00', '', 83, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?p=616', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
