(621, 1, '2025-10-23 16:52:04', '2025-10-23 16:52:04', 'A bold fusion of flirty and feminine, this four-piece set includes a white sweetheart corset top adorned with an oversized denim bow, paired with ultra-low-rise triple-belt denim shorts. Statement details include a sculpted tulle accented denim flower shoulder brooch, matching floral earrings, and a tailored denim cap topped with multitoned handmade blossoms. This look is custom couture with undeniable personality.\n<ul>\n 	<li>Care: Spot clean or dry clean only. Store hat and florals in breathable packaging.</li>\n</ul>', 'Lorem Ipsum', 'A bold fusion of flirty and feminine, this four-piece set includes a white sweetheart corset top adorned with an oversized denim bow, paired with ultra-low-rise triple-belt denim shorts', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '84-autosave-v1', '', '', '2025-10-23 16:52:04', '2025-10-23 16:52:04', '', 84, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?p=621', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
