(636, 1, '2025-10-23 16:57:36', '2025-10-23 16:57:36', 'This unapologetically edgy set blends romantic whimsy with street couture. The lace-up distressed denim bustier is trimmed with hand-sewn floral appliqués and layers of powder blue tulle, matched with frayed mid-rise denim shorts featuring peekaboo distressing and a soft tulle bustle. A dramatic denim headpiece with feathered detail and sculpted florals completes the runway-ready fantasy.\n\n&nbsp;', 'Lorem Ipsum', '<strong>Lorem Ipsum</strong> is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '86-autosave-v1', '', '', '2025-10-23 16:57:36', '2025-10-23 16:57:36', '', 86, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?p=636', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(637, 1, '2026-02-10 20:54:17', '2026-02-10 20:54:17', 'Turn heads in this vibrant hot-pink three-piece swim set that sparkles under the sun. The triangle bikini top and low-rise bottoms are adorned with rhinestone accents, while a sheer mesh cover-up ties it all together with playful glam. Heart-shaped charms at the waist add an extra touch of flirty drama, making this the ultimate pool-to-party look.\n<ul>\n 	<li>Care: Hand wash cold, lay flat to dry. Do not bleach.</li>\n</ul>', 'Heartbreaker Bikini Set', 'Turn heads in this vibrant hot-pink three-piece swim set that sparkles under the sun. The triangle bikini top and low-rise bottoms are adorned with rhinestone accents, while a sheer mesh cover-up ties it all together with playful glam. Heart-shaped charms at the waist add an extra touch of flirty drama, making this the ultimate pool-to-party look.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '87-autosave-v1', '', '', '2026-02-10 20:54:17', '2026-02-10 20:54:17', '', 87, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?p=637', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(650, 1, '2025-10-23 17:08:20', '2025-10-23 17:08:20', 'Make waves in this electric-blue bikini set that’s all about bold simplicity with a luxe twist. The halter-style top and tie-side bottoms are elevated with crystal hoop hardware and dangling charm details, giving the classic cut a glamorous upgrade. Perfect for beach days, pool parties, or resort getaways — this bikini is confidence in color.\n<ul>\n 	<li>Care: Hand wash cold, lay flat to dry. Avoid prolonged exposure to chlorine and saltwater to preserve color vibrancy.</li>\n</ul>', 'Lorem Ipsum', '<strong>Lorem Ipsum</strong> is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '90-autosave-v1', '', '', '2025-10-23 17:08:20', '2025-10-23 17:08:20', '', 90, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?p=650', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(655, 1, '2025-10-23 17:10:50', '2025-10-23 17:10:50', 'Bring out your untamed side with this bold leopard-print one-piece featuring sultry side cutouts and a plunging neckline. The halter tie adds adjustable comfort while the cutout design sculpts the waist for a sleek, flattering silhouette. Perfect for the woman who wants all eyes on her, this piece blends wild energy with sophisticated edge.\n<ul>\n 	<li>Care: Hand wash cold, lay flat to dry. Avoid wringing to preserve shape.</li>\n</ul>', 'Lorem Ipsum', '<strong>Lorem Ipsum</strong> is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '89-autosave-v1', '', '', '2025-10-23 17:10:50', '2025-10-23 17:10:50', '', 89, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?p=655', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(660, 1, '2025-10-23 17:15:51', '2025-10-23 17:15:51', 'Sweet as candy, this pastel pink bikini set is trimmed with ruffled edges, delicate bows, and tiny floral appliqués for the ultimate feminine touch. The triangle-cut top and tie-side bottoms keep the fit adjustable, while the playful details make this set perfect for a fun pool party or a dreamy beach day.\n<ul>\n 	<li>Care: Hand wash cold, lay flat to dry. Avoid soaking to preserve embellishments.</li>\n</ul>', 'Lorem Ipsum', '<strong>Lorem Ipsum</strong> is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '88-autosave-v1', '', '', '2025-10-23 17:15:51', '2025-10-23 17:15:51', '', 88, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?p=660', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(673, 1, '2025-10-23 17:36:42', '2025-10-23 17:36:42', 'Sweet as candy, this pastel pink bikini set is trimmed with ruffled edges, delicate bows, and tiny floral appliqués for the ultimate feminine touch. The triangle-cut top and tie-side bottoms keep the fit adjustable, while the playful details make this set perfect for a fun pool party or a dreamy beach day.\n<ul>\n 	<li>Care: Hand wash cold, lay flat to dry. Remove chain before washing.</li>\n</ul>', 'Lorem Ipsum', 'Sweet as candy, this pastel pink bikini set is trimmed with ruffled edges, delicate bows, and tiny floral appliqués for the ultimate feminine touch.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '91-autosave-v1', '', '', '2025-10-23 17:36:42', '2025-10-23 17:36:42', '', 91, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?p=673', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(716, 1, '2025-11-06 22:09:13', '2025-11-06 22:09:13', 'Playful, pouty, and primed for a main character moment — this schoolgirl remix is giving grown-up edge with a dash of mischief. The cropped white button-down features puffed sleeves and a bold triple bow bust detail crafted in signature red plaid, bringing charm and cheek in equal measure. Paired with voluminous red puff shorts adorned with a dramatic black rosette, this two-piece set is flirty, fearless, and ready to stir up some drama in the lunchroom (or the boardroom).\n<ul>\n 	<li>Care Instructions: Dry clean or spot clean only. Handle decorative elements with care.</li>\n 	<li>Size Range: 0–8 (custom sizing available upon request)</li>\n</ul>', 'Ci', 'Playful, pouty, and primed for a main character moment — this schoolgirl remix is giving grown-up edge with a dash of mischief.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '93-autosave-v1', '', '', '2025-11-06 22:09:13', '2025-11-06 22:09:13', '', 93, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?p=716', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(720, 1, '2025-10-23 18:14:32', '2025-10-23 18:14:32', 'Drape yourself in retro charm with a modern twist. The Crimson Couture Jumper Dress is a playful nod to vintage schoolgirl silhouettes, reimagined with bold elegance. This double-breasted mini jumper in a rich red hue features silver button details and a voluminous black rosette at the hem. Paired with a crisp puff-sleeve blouse and oversized satin bow tie, this look exudes confident femininity with a dash of theatrical flair.\n<ul>\n 	<li>Care Instructions: Dry clean only</li>\n 	<li>(custom sizing available upon request)</li>\n</ul>', 'Lorem Ipsum', 'Drape yourself in retro charm with a modern twist. The Crimson Couture Jumper Dress is a playful nod to vintage schoolgirl silhouettes, reimagined with bold elegance.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '94-autosave-v1', '', '', '2025-10-23 18:14:32', '2025-10-23 18:14:32', '', 94, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?p=720', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(725, 1, '2025-10-23 17:49:45', '2025-10-23 17:49:45', 'For the rule-breakers and statement-makers — this daring set fuses punk edge with romantic flair. The off-shoulder top stuns in cherry red, detailed with dimensional black floral appliqués and a statement crystal brooch for extra heat. Paired with a high-shine faux leather pencil skirt adorned with bold red sequin blooms, it’s giving unapologetic glam from sidewalk to spotlight.', 'Lorem Ipsum', '<strong>Lorem Ipsum</strong> is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '95-autosave-v1', '', '', '2025-10-23 17:49:45', '2025-10-23 17:49:45', '', 95, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?p=725', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(734, 1, '2025-10-23 17:58:37', '2025-10-23 17:58:37', 'Bold and cheeky, this two-piece look puts a theatrical spin on timeless plaid. The blouse features a rich red-and black check red print with sequin appliqué and a black lace waist peplum that cinches with vintage flair. The matching fitted skirt keeps it punchy in oversized buffalo plaid, accented with a dramatic oversized flower appliqué. The cherry drop earrings, sculpted heart glasses, and velvet oversized collar hat complete the outfit with a flair that’s equal parts retro kitsch and runway-ready sass.\n<ul>\n 	<li>Care Instructions: Dry clean only. Avoid excessive moisture near lace and embellishments.</li>\n</ul>', 'Lorem Ipsum', '<strong>Lorem Ipsum</strong> is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '96-autosave-v1', '', '', '2025-10-23 17:58:37', '2025-10-23 17:58:37', '', 96, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?p=734', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(743, 1, '2025-10-23 18:04:59', '2025-10-23 18:04:59', 'A little bit schoolgirl, a whole lot of edge. This red plaid one-shoulder corset mini commands attention with luxe floral appliqué, black mesh flower detailing, and draped gold chain accents. Designed for the bold, the brash, and the beautifully rebellious, this mini dress makes plaid runway-ready with structure, flair, and attitude.\n<ul>\n 	<li>Care Instructions: Spot clean or dry clean only</li>\n</ul>', 'Lorem Ipsum', 'A little bit schoolgirl, a whole lot of edge. This red plaid one-shoulder corset mini commands attention with luxe floral appliqué, black mesh flower detailing, and draped gold chain accents.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '128-autosave-v1', '', '', '2025-10-23 18:04:59', '2025-10-23 18:04:59', '', 128, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?p=743', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(763, 1, '2025-10-23 18:17:32', '2025-10-23 18:17:32', '<h2>Newsletter</h2>							\n							<h2>Join Our Newsletter\n</h2>															<img width=\"600\" height=\"800\" src=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-Leto-opt-in-Home-Page-1.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-Leto-opt-in-Home-Page-1.png 600w, https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-Leto-opt-in-Home-Page-1-225x300.png 225w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" />', 'Newsletter', '', 'publish', 'closed', 'closed', '', 'newsletter', '', '', '2025-10-23 18:19:39', '2025-10-23 18:19:39', '', 0, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?page_id=763', 0, 'page', '', 0),
