(765, 1, '2025-10-23 18:51:17', '2025-10-23 18:51:17', 'This bold and flirtatious ensemble blends classic prep with a rebellious twist. The crimson red mini dress features plaid-trimmed ruffles, a lace-up corset bodice, and pleated hemline, layered over a billowy white blouse with dramatic sleeves. Gold chains and plaid bows add a cheeky accent, while the matching cap seals the school girl gone-rogue fantasy\n<ul>\n 	<li>Care Instructions: Spot clean or dry clean only. Store chains carefully to avoid tangling.</li>\n</ul>', 'Lorem Ipsum', 'Drape yourself in untamed drama with this fierce, high-fashion mini. The Dangerously Divine Dress turns every hallway into a catwalk with its sheer black mesh base, voluminous red ruffle appliqués, and bold faux fur trim.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '131-autosave-v1', '', '', '2025-10-23 18:51:17', '2025-10-23 18:51:17', '', 131, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?p=765', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
