(790, 1, '2025-10-23 18:31:10', '2025-10-23 18:31:10', 'Unapologetically bold, the Plaid &amp; Petals Power Dress fuses punk rebellion with red carpet elegance. This one shoulder mini stuns in crimson plaid, elevated with rich gold-and-black floral appliqué and an oversized mesh rose bursting from the shoulder. Finished with a dramatic chain belt and bold side bloom, this look doesn’t whisper — it commands.\n<ul>\n 	<li>Care Instructions: Spot clean or dry clean only. Store flat or hang carefully to avoid crushing appliqué.</li>\n</ul>', 'Lorem Ipsum', 'Unapologetically bold, the Plaid &amp; Petals Power Dress fuses punk rebellion with red carpet elegance. This one shoulder mini stuns in crimson plaid, elevated with rich gold-and-black floral appliqué and an oversized mesh rose bursting from the shoulder. Finished with a dramatic chain belt and bold side bloom, this look doesn’t whisper — it commands', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '129-autosave-v1', '', '', '2025-10-23 18:31:10', '2025-10-23 18:31:10', '', 129, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?p=790', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(807, 1, '2025-10-23 18:41:43', '2025-10-23 18:41:43', 'Drape yourself in untamed drama with this fierce, high-fashion mini. The Dangerously Divine Dress turns every\nhallway into a catwalk with its sheer black mesh base, voluminous red ruffle appliqués, and bold faux fur trim.\nOversized floral elements on the bust and hip sculpt a daring silhouette that screams haute couture rebellion. The wrist cuffs add extra flair for those ready to strike a pose and own the night', 'Lorem Ipsum', '<strong>Lorem Ipsum</strong> is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '130-autosave-v1', '', '', '2025-10-23 18:41:43', '2025-10-23 18:41:43', '', 130, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?p=807', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(848, 1, '2025-10-23 19:02:05', '2025-10-23 19:02:05', 'Command the room in this bold yet playful ensemble that blends classic punk vibes with modern high fashion. The form-fitting red turtleneck is detailed with dimensional black rose appliqués, giving a nod to theatrical romance. Paired with red and black plaid shorts, the set features a draped gold chain accent and a surprise red tulle train cascading from the back for dramatic flair. A matching red hat with black rosettes and netting completes the look — perfect for fashion shows, creative editorials, and style-forward statements.\n<ul>\n 	<li>Care Instructions: Spot clean or dry clean only. Store hat with care to preserve shape.</li>\n</ul>', 'Lorem Ipsum', '<strong>Lorem Ipsum</strong> is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '132-autosave-v1', '', '', '2025-10-23 19:02:05', '2025-10-23 19:02:05', '', 132, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?p=848', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(869, 1, '2025-10-23 19:12:53', '2025-10-23 19:12:53', 'This couture-style stunner commands the spotlight with its oversized 3D red rose bodice layered over a sheer purple long-sleeve base. The waist is cinched with a red tulle sash featuring cascading gold chains, adding glitz and movement. A multi-tiered ombré skirt fades from deep violet to fuchsia, creating rich visual drama with every step. Inspired by Latin romance and avant-garde fashion, this gown is made for icons—not wallflowers.\n<ul>\n 	<li>Care Instructions: Dry clean only. Avoid steam directly on flower structure.</li>\n 	<li>Special Note: Includes matching red rose hair accessory</li>\n</ul>', 'Lorem Ipsum', '<strong>Lorem Ipsum</strong> is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '134-autosave-v1', '', '', '2025-10-23 19:12:53', '2025-10-23 19:12:53', '', 134, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?p=869', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(885, 1, '2025-10-23 19:19:44', '2025-10-23 19:19:44', 'Command attention in this fiery, editorial-ready set that mixes playful asymmetry with glam rock edge. The cropped top is a bold statement in cherry red, adorned with black floral appliqués and shimmering crystal brooch accents. Sculptural white off-shoulder sleeves and matching black mesh accessories give this piece couture-level drama. Paired with a sleek black faux leather pencil skirt that hugs the hips and finishes with fiery red sequin floral appliqués, this look was made for the spotlight.', 'Lorem Ipsum', '<strong>Lorem Ipsum</strong> is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '135-autosave-v1', '', '', '2025-10-23 19:19:44', '2025-10-23 19:19:44', '', 135, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?p=885', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(890, 1, '2025-10-23 19:28:16', '2025-10-23 19:28:16', 'Theatrical elegance meets cheeky rebellion in The Big Finish, a playful plaid ensemble designed to turn heads and steal the spotlight. This look features a black mesh long-sleeve mock neck bodysuit paired with a custom asymmetrical tartan mini skirt that cascades into a soft tail in the back. A sculpted black rose detail and double gold chain belt add flair, while the true showstopper is the oversized red satin bow placed at the lower back— commanding attention with every step. Red ruffle-embellished platform heels complete the fantasy, bringing flirty confidence to life.', 'Lorem Ipsum', '<strong>Lorem Ipsum</strong> is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '137-autosave-v1', '', '', '2025-10-23 19:28:16', '2025-10-23 19:28:16', '', 137, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?p=890', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(914, 1, '2025-10-23 19:44:37', '2025-10-23 19:44:37', 'Rich chocolate faux-fur meets opulent gold in this powerful runway-ready look. A high-neck silhouette is layered with cascading golden chains and statement jewelry accents, embodying strength and luxury. The mini skirt is finished with a bold embroidered appliqué and layered chain belt for a commanding presence. Designed for leaders and icons, this set transforms tradition into modern majesty.\n<ul>\n 	<li>Care: Spot clean gently with damp cloth. Dry clean recommended to preserve chainwork and appliqué.</li>\n</ul>', 'Lorem Ipsum', '<strong>Lorem Ipsum</strong> is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '140-autosave-v1', '', '', '2025-10-23 19:44:37', '2025-10-23 19:44:37', '', 140, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?p=914', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(921, 1, '2025-10-23 19:50:37', '2025-10-23 19:50:37', 'Pretty in pink, this faux-fur mini set is all about playful femininity. The bubblegum hue is paired with sheer mesh sleeves that add a touch of romance, while pearl draping at the waist creates soft elegance. Accented with fluffy heart and bow appliqués, plus a matching faux-fur heart purse with pearl strap, this look is a pastel dream made for editorial spreads, Valentine showcases, or statement streetwear moments.\n<ul>\n 	<li>Care: Hand wash cold, lay flat to dry. Do not bleach. Professional dry clean recommended for longevity.</li>\n</ul>', 'Lorem Ipsum', '<strong>Lorem Ipsum</strong> is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '141-autosave-v1', '', '', '2025-10-23 19:50:37', '2025-10-23 19:50:37', '', 141, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?p=921', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(930, 1, '2025-10-23 19:55:18', '2025-10-23 19:55:18', 'A cosmic vision in black, the Starlight Noir is the ultimate statement of power and poise. This faux-fur two-piece features a fitted mini skirt and cropped vest, both accented with silver chains that drape like constellations. The long-sleeve underlay sparkles with subtle rhinestone studs, while the matching beret crowned with a metallic clover makes this look equal parts Parisian chic and futuristic glam. The silver star charm detail adds the perfect finishing touch — a reminder that this look was made to shine.\n<ul>\n 	<li>Care: Professional dry clean only. Spot clean embellishments with care.</li>\n</ul>', 'Lorem Ipsum', '<strong>Lorem Ipsum</strong> is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '142-autosave-v1', '', '', '2025-10-23 19:55:18', '2025-10-23 19:55:18', '', 142, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?p=930', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(937, 1, '2025-10-23 19:59:35', '2025-10-23 19:59:35', 'Dark romance takes center stage in this deep crimson faux-fur mini set. The off-shoulder neckline is finished with a velvet bow and pearl accent, balancing sweetness with allure. Embroidered florals bloom across the skirt, while draped silver cross chains add edge and drama. A perfect statement piece for evening glamour, fashion editorials, or a runway moment that demands both elegance and rebellion.\n<ul>\n 	<li>Care: Hand wash cold or professional dry clean only. Avoid harsh detergents to preserve embroidery and\nhardware</li>\n</ul>', 'Lorem Ipsum', '<strong>Lorem Ipsum</strong> is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '143-autosave-v1', '', '', '2025-10-23 19:59:35', '2025-10-23 19:59:35', '', 143, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?p=937', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(944, 1, '2025-10-23 20:03:29', '2025-10-23 20:03:29', 'Command the spotlight in this striking grey ensemble that fuses strength and playfulness. A sleek faux-leather vest is accented with bold star appliqués, while layered chain details bring edge and dimension. The faux-fur trimmed shorts add texture and movement, paired with dramatic fur arm warmers that complete the futuristic warrior vibe. This look is made for trailblazers who shine unapologetically.', 'Lorem Ipsum', '<strong>Lorem Ipsum</strong> is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '144-autosave-v1', '', '', '2025-10-23 20:03:29', '2025-10-23 20:03:29', '', 144, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?p=944', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(953, 1, '2025-10-23 20:11:02', '2025-10-23 20:11:02', 'Soft meets statement in this pastel aqua faux-fur mini set, blooming with oversized floral appliqués and pearl accents. The plush fur vest layers effortlessly over the sleek knit base, while the skirt’s delicate chain belt adds a touch of sparkle and elegance. Fresh and feminine, this look channels playful sophistication, perfect for spring showcases or editorial spreads that call for a pop of color.\n<ul>\n 	<li>Care: Spot clean only. Professional dry clean recommended to preserve fur texture and appliqué detailing.</li>\n</ul>', 'Lorem Ipsum', '<strong>Lorem Ipsum</strong> is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '145-autosave-v1', '', '', '2025-10-23 20:11:02', '2025-10-23 20:11:02', '', 145, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?p=953', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(960, 1, '2025-10-23 20:46:11', '2025-10-23 20:46:11', 'A romantic twist on bold structure, this burgundy faux-fur and tulle set takes center stage with its layered ruffle neckline and silver floral appliqué accent. The voluminous bubble skirt adds playful drama, decorated with embroidered butterfly motifs that bring movement and lightness to the rich tone. This look bridges fantasy and fashion, making it a dreamy choice for both editorial features and statement soirées.\n<ul>\n 	<li>Care: Spot clean only. Professional dry clean recommended to protect appliqués and fabric layers.</li>\n</ul>', 'Lorem Ipsum', '<strong>Lorem Ipsum</strong> is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '146-autosave-v1', '', '', '2025-10-23 20:46:11', '2025-10-23 20:46:11', '', 146, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?p=960', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(965, 1, '2025-10-23 20:47:55', '2025-10-23 20:47:55', 'Bold and untamed, the Leopard Empress channels raw power and refined glamour. The faux-fur leopard print is paired with cream knit sleeves and cuffs, blending wild edge with luxe comfort. Gold floral appliqués bloom across the bodice and skirt, enhanced by layered chain detailing. Finished with a matching beret, this look commands the room with unapologetic confidence.', 'Lorem Ipsum', '<strong>Lorem Ipsum</strong> is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '147-autosave-v1', '', '', '2025-10-23 20:47:55', '2025-10-23 20:47:55', '', 147, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?p=965', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(974, 1, '2025-10-23 20:54:12', '2025-10-23 20:54:12', 'Bold and untamed, the Leopard Empress channels raw power and refined glamour. The faux-fur leopard print is paired with cream knit sleeves and cuffs, blending wild edge with luxe comfort. Gold floral appliqués bloom across the bodice and skirt, enhanced by layered chain detailing. Finished with a matching beret, this look commands the room with unapologetic confidence.', 'Lorem Ipsum', '<strong>Lorem Ipsum</strong> is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '148-autosave-v1', '', '', '2025-10-23 20:54:12', '2025-10-23 20:54:12', '', 148, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?p=974', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(981, 1, '2025-10-23 21:06:43', '2025-10-23 21:06:43', 'A micro-length metallic floral sheath dress drenched in glimmer and draped in drama. The multi-tonal floral sequins explode in violets, magentas, and silver on a stretch velvet base, while bold sculptural tulle ruffles crown the shoulders and wrists like couture armor. A black organza rosette blooms at the hip, finishing the look with runway intensity.\n\n<strong>Details:</strong>\n<ul>\n 	<li>Care: Dry clean only</li>\n</ul>', 'Lorem Ipsum', '<strong>Lorem Ipsum</strong> is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '149-autosave-v1', '', '', '2025-10-23 21:06:43', '2025-10-23 21:06:43', '', 149, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?p=981', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(985, 1, '2025-10-23 21:12:34', '2025-10-23 21:12:34', 'Turn heads and own the room in this electric fuchsia gown designed to radiate confidence. Crafted from a rich velvet-touch stretch fabric, the Hot Shot Halter Gown features an eye-catching cascade of floral appliqués blooming across the bodice, accented with gold beadwork for a fiery finish. The halter neckline gives way to an elegant crossback, balancing structure and sensuality. A sleek thigh-high slit adds drama and movement to this commanding silhouette.\n<ul>\n 	<li>Care Instructions: Dry clean only</li>\n</ul>', 'Lorem Ipsum', '<strong>Lorem Ipsum</strong> is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '153-autosave-v1', '', '', '2025-10-23 21:12:34', '2025-10-23 21:12:34', '', 153, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?p=985', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(993, 1, '2026-02-10 20:16:48', '2026-02-10 20:16:48', 'The Noir Bubble Cocktail is a statement dress that embodies vintage Parisian mourning with a modern twist. Crafted in sculpted matte satin, this one-piece cocktail silhouette features an exaggerated bubble skirt and structured bodice, cinched at the waist for dramatic impact. A bold rosette with gold stud accents sits at the hip, while a trailing veil of sheer black tulle falls from one shoulder for a theatrical finish.\n\nFabric: Matte satin, crinoline structure, gold stud detailing, tulle overlay\nCare Instructions: Dry clean only', 'Noir Bubble Cocktail', 'The Noir Bubble Cocktail is a statement dress that embodies vintage Parisian mourning with a modern twist. Crafted in sculpted matte satin, this one-piece cocktail silhouette features an exaggerated bubble skirt and structured bodice, cinched at the waist for dramatic impact.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '156-autosave-v1', '', '', '2026-02-10 20:16:48', '2026-02-10 20:16:48', '', 156, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?p=993', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(1002, 1, '2025-10-23 21:32:34', '2025-10-23 21:32:34', 'A cottagecore fantasy meets streetwear sass in this flirty, feminine set. The look includes a hand-embellished denim vest adorned with florals and sequins, a lace and tulle bandeau top, and a pleated denim-ruffle mini skirt topped with signature floral appliqués. Statement sheer gloves and 3D floral sunglasses elevate the outfit into full fairytale couture.', 'Lorem Ipsum', '<strong>Lorem Ipsum</strong> is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '157-autosave-v1', '', '', '2025-10-23 21:32:34', '2025-10-23 21:32:34', '', 157, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?p=1002', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(1028, 1, '2025-10-23 22:01:27', '2025-10-23 22:01:27', 'This two-piece set in baby blue polyester stretch fabric pairs a sheer tie-front blouse with a high-waisted ruffle slit skirt. The blouse features soft balloon sleeves and oversized rosette appliqués, creating a romantic yet playful silhouette. The skirt’s cascading ruffle trim adds fluid movement, while the light-stretch construction ensures comfort and ease of wear. Designed without zippers or buttons, this effortless look blends feminine softness with modern versatility — perfect for evening elegance or daytime chic.', 'Lorem Ipsum', '<strong>Lorem Ipsum</strong> is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '189-autosave-v1', '', '', '2025-10-23 22:01:27', '2025-10-23 22:01:27', '', 189, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?p=1028', 0, 'revision', '', 0);
