(1035, 1, '2025-10-23 22:16:55', '2025-10-23 22:16:55', 'This two-piece set blends whimsical softness with couture detail. The cropped cotton top is adorned with delicate floral appliqués, paired with a voluminous ruffle mesh puff skirt that moves with airy elegance. Designed in lightweight materials for comfort and statement style, this look is a modern-day fairytale moment. Perfect for editorial shoots, red carpet entrances, or any occasion where romance meets high fashion.\n<ul>\n 	<li>Care: Dry clean only to preserve appliqués and mesh ruffles</li>\n</ul>', 'Lorem Ipsum', '<strong>Lorem Ipsum</strong> is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '190-autosave-v1', '', '', '2025-10-23 22:16:55', '2025-10-23 22:16:55', '', 190, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?p=1035', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(1040, 1, '2025-10-23 22:19:26', '2025-10-23 22:19:26', 'This two-piece set shines in metallic silver, pairing a structured corset-inspired top with a fitted mini skirt. The top features floral appliqué detailing across the bodice with a sculpted fit and a narrower back closure for a sleek finish. The matching skirt carries coordinating embellishment for a seamless look. Complete with matching silver cottonstretch gloves, this ensemble delivers high-shine drama and elegance with every movement. Designed in polyester/elastane with light stretch for comfort and form.\n<ul>\n 	<li>Care: Spot clean or professional dry clean only to preserve metallic finish and embellishment. Gloves may be hand washed separately.</li>\n</ul>', 'Lorem Ipsum', '<strong>Lorem Ipsum</strong> is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '192-autosave-v1', '', '', '2025-10-23 22:19:26', '2025-10-23 22:19:26', '', 192, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?p=1040', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(1047, 1, '2025-10-23 22:22:55', '2025-10-23 22:22:55', 'This violet dress is a showstopping blend of sheer allure and couture detail. Crafted in cotton and mesh, the fitted long-sleeve bodice is semi-sheer with hand-applied floral appliqués that frame the neckline and chest. A voluminous ruffle mesh skirt flows from the waist, tied together with a lustrous silk ribbon belt for a dramatic, feminine finish. Bold yet elegant, this piece is designed for the runway, red carpet, or any unforgettable occasion.\n<ul>\n 	<li>Care: Dry clean only to preserve appliqué, silk belt, and layered mesh volume</li>\n</ul>', 'Lorem Ipsum', '<strong>Lorem Ipsum</strong> is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '193-autosave-v1', '', '', '2025-10-23 22:22:55', '2025-10-23 22:22:55', '', 193, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?p=1047', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(1052, 1, '2025-10-23 22:26:13', '2025-10-23 22:26:13', 'This two-piece set in a bold fuchsia cotton-satin blend pairs a ruched crop top with draped shoulders and jewel clasp detail, with a matching high-waisted ruched skirt that elongates the silhouette. The rich satin sheen and gathered construction create a figure-flattering fit that balances elegance with statement power. Perfect for cocktail nights, red carpet appearances, or making an unforgettable entrance.', 'Lorem Ipsum', '<strong>Lorem Ipsum</strong> is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '194-autosave-v1', '', '', '2025-10-23 22:26:13', '2025-10-23 22:26:13', '', 194, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?p=1052', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(1057, 1, '2025-10-23 22:34:10', '2025-10-23 22:34:10', 'This powder-blue two-piece set pairs a structured corset-style top with a sleek satin mini skirt. The corset features lace trim, boning details, and oversized floral appliqués that bring texture and dimension to the look. The coordinating satin skirt is cut in a fitted silhouette with a rosette accent at the hem for a flirty finish. Designed in non-stretch satin for a sculpted fit, this set is equal parts romantic and bold — perfect for cocktail nights or editorial styling.\n<ul>\n 	<li>Care: Professional dry clean only to preserve satin finish and floral detailing.</li>\n</ul>', 'Lorem Ipsum', '<strong>Lorem Ipsum</strong> is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '196-autosave-v1', '', '', '2025-10-23 22:34:10', '2025-10-23 22:34:10', '', 196, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?p=1057', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(1061, 1, '2025-10-23 22:41:09', '2025-10-23 22:41:09', 'This lilac two-piece set elevates the corset-and-tulle silhouette with added drama. The structured corset top is adorned with oversized rosette appliqués and delicate embellishments, paired with sheer frill mesh long sleeves for extra texture. The layered asymmetrical tulle skirt cascades with volume and movement, blending romance and couture edge. Designed in non-stretch polyester/elastane, the tailored fit creates a regal, statement-making look fit for the runway or red carpet.\n<ul>\n 	<li>Care: Dry clean only to preserve embellishments and layered tulle structure.</li>\n</ul>', 'Lorem Ipsum', '<strong>Lorem Ipsum</strong> is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '197-autosave-v1', '', '', '2025-10-23 22:41:09', '2025-10-23 22:41:09', '', 197, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?p=1061', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(1066, 1, '2025-10-23 22:45:14', '2025-10-23 22:45:14', 'A sultry twist on sweet, this deep fuchsia cap stuns with shimmering berry embellishments, high-gloss florals, and luxe bronze-toned leaves. Its velvety texture and wine-colored accents bring a moody sophistication to your accessory game. Think garden fairy meets runway diva—perfect for photoshoots, fashion showcases, or a signature streetwear slay.', 'Lorem Ipsum', '<strong>Lorem Ipsum</strong> is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '201-autosave-v1', '', '', '2025-10-23 22:45:14', '2025-10-23 22:45:14', '', 201, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?p=1066', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(1067, 1, '2025-10-23 22:57:50', '2025-10-23 22:57:50', 'Streetwear meets soft romance in this reimagined denim cap. Featuring a gradient arrangement of hand-cut rosettes in varying denim washes—ranging from deep indigo to powder blue—this hat brings a chic twist to casual. Whether paired with a denim-on-denim ensemble or used to offset a sleek look, it’s the kind of accessory that turns heads while keeping the sun out of your eyes.', 'Denim Rosette Baseball Cap', '<strong>Lorem Ipsum</strong> is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '206-autosave-v1', '', '', '2025-10-23 22:57:50', '2025-10-23 22:57:50', '', 206, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?p=1067', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(1068, 1, '2025-10-23 23:10:25', '2025-10-23 23:10:25', 'Serving unapologetic doll-core energy, these hot-pink rectangle frames are decked out with Barbie-inspired\ncharms: a cameo portrait, starbursts, heels, lips, and even a mini blow dryer. Fun, campy, and instantly nostalgic,\nthey’re the ultimate playful accessory for collectors and fashion rebels alike.', 'Barbie Dream Frames', '<strong>Lorem Ipsum</strong> is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '213-autosave-v1', '', '', '2025-10-23 23:10:25', '2025-10-23 23:10:25', '', 213, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?p=1068', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(1069, 1, '2025-10-23 23:15:16', '2025-10-23 23:15:16', 'Dripping in mermaid-core fantasy, these iridescent heart-shaped frames sparkle with seashell appliqués, rhinestone crusting, and pearlized details. Cascading chains with lavender heart charms complete the undersea siren effect, while a golden center medallion ties it all together. The perfect showstopper for festivals, editorials, or anyone channeling oceanic royalty.', 'Siren’s Treasure Shades', '<strong>Lorem Ipsum</strong> is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '215-autosave-v1', '', '', '2025-10-23 23:15:16', '2025-10-23 23:15:16', '', 215, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?p=1069', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(1070, 1, '2025-10-23 23:17:41', '2025-10-23 23:17:41', 'Feminine with a sparkle that speaks volumes, Rose Quartz Kisses brings a vintage silhouette to life with glimmering rose gold glitter and delicate felt rosebuds. These pink-tinted cat-eye frames are perfect for brunch dates, garden parties, or just channeling your inner flirt.', 'Rose Quartz Kisses', '<strong>Lorem Ipsum</strong> is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '216-autosave-v1', '', '', '2025-10-23 23:17:41', '2025-10-23 23:17:41', '', 216, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?p=1070', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(1071, 1, '2025-10-23 23:19:21', '2025-10-23 23:19:21', 'For the diva that doesn’t whisper—she enters with feathers and flair. Showgirl Smoke is a bold, burlesque-inspired pair of shades featuring square black frames drenched in shimmering gold and onyx rhinestones. One corner is dramatically topped with a plume of dark feathers and finished with a glitzy gold applique flower. Equal parts Moulin Rouge and Met Gala.', 'Showgirl Smoke', '<strong>Lorem Ipsum</strong> is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '217-autosave-v1', '', '', '2025-10-23 23:19:21', '2025-10-23 23:19:21', '', 217, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?p=1071', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(1072, 1, '2025-10-23 23:26:43', '2025-10-23 23:26:43', 'If Elle Woods and a Bratz doll had a sunglasses baby — this would be it. These sharp cat-eye frames feature ombré pink lenses trimmed in sparkling rhinestones, lined with pastel gems, and crowned with a baby pink bow charm on the corner for that wink of girly drama.', 'Pinkie Promise Rhinestone Frames', '<strong>Lorem Ipsum</strong> is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '250-autosave-v1', '', '', '2025-10-23 23:26:43', '2025-10-23 23:26:43', '', 250, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?p=1072', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(1073, 1, '2025-10-23 23:33:20', '2025-10-23 23:33:20', 'These hot-pink heart frames are crowned with oversized iridescent jewels in rainbow hues, catching light from every angle. Bold yet playful, they’re made for festival season, glam photoshoots, or anytime you want to shine unapologetically.\n<ul>\n 	<li>Care: Spot clean gently; store in protective pouch to prevent scratching</li>\n</ul>', 'Prism Heart Frames', 'These hot-pink heart frames are crowned with oversized iridescent jewels in rainbow hues, catching light from every angle. Bold yet playful, they’re made for festival season, glam photoshoots, or anytime you want to shine unapologetically.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '251-autosave-v1', '', '', '2025-10-23 23:33:20', '2025-10-23 23:33:20', '', 251, 'https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/?p=1073', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(1074, 1, '2025-10-27 19:42:10', '2025-10-27 19:42:10', '<img width=\"600\" height=\"900\" src=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Pink-Gown-Home-Page-Header.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Pink-Gown-Home-Page-Header.png 600w, https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Pink-Gown-Home-Page-Header-200x300.png 200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" />																<h2>Amber Leto <br>\nOne of a Kind Designs</h2>							\n				<p>Designed to Be the Main Character.</p><p>Step into a world where every outfit demands a spotlight. One-of-a-kind fashion for women who dare to be unforgettable.</p>								<a href=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/shop-the-collection/\">\n									View More\n					</a>\n									<h2>About the Designer\n</h2>							\n				<p>Amber Leto is a Scottsdale-based fashion designer with a lifelong passion for turning the ordinary into the extraordinary. With a gifted eye for color, detail, and drama, Amber creates one-ofa-kind gowns, bold denim pieces, and statement accessories that transform every entrance into a moment worth remembering. Before launching her brand, Amber earned multiple degrees in psychology — including a Doctorate in Clinical Psychology — and built a decades-long career helping people feel confident, safe, and empowered.</p>								<a href=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/about-the-designer/\">\n									Learn more\n					</a>\n																			<img width=\"504\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-About-page-504x1024.jpeg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-About-page-504x1024.jpeg 504w, https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-About-page-600x1219.jpeg 600w, https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-About-page-148x300.jpeg 148w, https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-About-page.jpeg 640w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 504px) 100vw, 504px\" />																<h2>The Collections</h2>							\n																	<img width=\"600\" height=\"800\" src=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-Leto-Denim-Home-Page-.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-Leto-Denim-Home-Page-.jpg 600w, https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-Leto-Denim-Home-Page--225x300.jpg 225w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" />																<h2>Fall</h2>							\n				<p>Denim Couture: “From rugged to regal. This isn’t your average denim.”</p>								<a href=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/product-category/fall/\">\n									View More\n					</a>\n									<h2>Winter</h2>							\n				<p>Leopard Luxe: “Untamed. Unmatched. Unapologetic.”</p>								<a href=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/product-category/winter/\">\n									View More\n					</a>\n																			<img width=\"600\" height=\"800\" src=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-Leto-Leopard-Home-Page-.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-Leto-Leopard-Home-Page-.jpg 600w, https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-Leto-Leopard-Home-Page--225x300.jpg 225w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" />																										<img width=\"600\" height=\"800\" src=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-Leto-Accessories-Home-Page.jpg\" alt=\"\" src