(1101, 1, '2025-10-27 20:42:58', '2025-10-27 20:42:58', '<img width=\"600\" height=\"900\" src=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Pink-Gown-Home-Page-Header.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Pink-Gown-Home-Page-Header.png 600w, https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Pink-Gown-Home-Page-Header-200x300.png 200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" />																<h2>Amber Leto <br>\nOne of a Kind Designs</h2>							\n				<p>Designed to Be the Main Character.</p><p>Step into a world where every outfit demands a spotlight. One-of-a-kind fashion for women who dare to be unforgettable.</p>								<a href=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/shop-the-collection/\">\n									View More\n					</a>\n									<h2>About the Designer\n</h2>							\n				<p>Amber Leto is a Scottsdale-based fashion designer with a lifelong passion for turning the ordinary into the extraordinary. With a gifted eye for color, detail, and drama, Amber creates one-ofa-kind gowns, bold denim pieces, and statement accessories that transform every entrance into a moment worth remembering. Before launching her brand, Amber earned multiple degrees in psychology — including a Doctorate in Clinical Psychology — and built a decades-long career helping people feel confident, safe, and empowered.</p>								<a href=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/about-the-designer/\">\n									Learn more\n					</a>\n																			<img width=\"504\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-About-page-504x1024.jpeg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-About-page-504x1024.jpeg 504w, https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-About-page-600x1219.jpeg 600w, https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-About-page-148x300.jpeg 148w, https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-About-page.jpeg 640w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 504px) 100vw, 504px\" />																<h2>The Collections</h2>							\n																	<img width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/1jJvZC8Q-300x300-1.jpeg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/1jJvZC8Q-300x300-1.jpeg 300w, https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/1jJvZC8Q-300x300-1-150x150.jpeg 150w, https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/1jJvZC8Q-300x300-1-100x100.jpeg 100w, https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/1jJvZC8Q-300x300-1-50x50.jpeg 50w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" />																<h2>Fall</h2>							\n				<p>Denim Couture: “From rugged to regal. This isn’t your average denim.”</p>								<a href=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/product-category/fall/\">\n									View More\n					</a>\n									<h2>Winter</h2>							\n				<p>Leopard Luxe: “Untamed. Unmatched. Unapologetic.”</p>								<a href=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/product-category/winter/\">\n									View More\n					</a>\n																			<img width=\"640\" height=\"960\" src=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/9VkCEU8w.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/9VkCEU8w.png 640w, https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/9VkCEU8w-600x900.png 600w, https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/9VkCEU8w-200x300.png 200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" />																										<img width=\"640\" height=\"828\" src=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/72Bmsh7A.jpeg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/72Bmsh7A.jpeg 640w, https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/72Bmsh7A-600x776.jpeg 600w, https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/72Bmsh7A-232x300.jpeg 232w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" />																<h2>Spring</h2>							\n				<p>Accessories: “Even your sunglasses deserve a standing ovation.”</p>								<a href=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/product-category/spring/\">\n									View More\n					</a>\n									<h2>Summer</h2>							\n				<p>Leopard Luxe: “Untamed. Unmatched. Unapologetic.”</p>								<a href=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/product-category/summer/\">\n									View More\n					</a>\n																			<img width=\"640\" height=\"960\" src=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/NiLTTjAi.jpeg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/NiLTTjAi.jpeg 640w, https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/NiLTTjAi-600x900.jpeg 600w, https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/NiLTTjAi-200x300.jpeg 200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 640px) 100vw, 640px\" />																										<img width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/ygzRQDFA-300x300-1.jpeg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/ygzRQDFA-300x300-1.jpeg 300w, https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/ygzRQDFA-300x300-1-150x150.jpeg 150w, https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/ygzRQDFA-300x300-1-100x100.jpeg 100w, https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/ygzRQDFA-300x300-1-50x50.jpeg 50w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" />																<h2>Couture</h2>							\n				<p>Denim Couture: “From rugged to regal. This isn’t your average denim.”</p>								<a href=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/product-category/bridal/\">\n									View More\n					</a>\n									<h2>Red Carpet Ready</h2>							\n				<p>Leopard Luxe: “Untamed. Unmatched. Unapologetic.”</p>								<a href=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/product-category/red-carpet-couture/\">\n									View More\n					</a>\n																			<img width=\"300\" height=\"300\" src=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/z1QuDfeQ-300x300-1.jpeg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/z1QuDfeQ-300x300-1.jpeg 300w, https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/z1QuDfeQ-300x300-1-150x150.jpeg 150w, https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/z1QuDfeQ-300x300-1-100x100.jpeg 100w, https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/z1QuDfeQ-300x300-1-50x50.jpeg 50w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 300px) 100vw, 300px\" />																										<img width=\"600\" height=\"800\" src=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-Leto-Accessories-Home-Page.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-Leto-Accessories-Home-Page.jpg 600w, https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-Leto-Accessories-Home-Page-225x300.jpg 225w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" />																<h2>Accessories</h2>							\n				<p>Accessories: “Even your sunglasses deserve a standing ovation.”</p>								<a href=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/product-category/accessories/\">\n									View More\n					</a>\n																			<img width=\"600\" height=\"800\" src=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-Leto-Custom-Designs-Home-Page-.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-Leto-Custom-Designs-Home-Page-.jpg 600w, https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-Leto-Custom-Designs-Home-Page--225x300.jpg 225w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" />																<h2>Custom Orders\n</h2>							\n				<p>Have an idea for something extraordinary?<br />Let’s collaborate to create a custom piece made<br />just for you – crafted with care, passion, and attention to detail.</p>								<a href=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/custom-orders/\">\n									View More\n					</a>\n									<h2>Shop The Collections\n</h2>							\n				<p>Discover our signature collections, crafted with precision and artistry. <br />From everyday statements to couture moments, find what speaks to you.</p>			<h2>Summer line\n</h2>					<h2>Get 20% Off</h2>										<a href=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/shop-the-collection/\">\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M256 8c137 0 248 111 248 248S393 504 256 504 8 393 8 256 119 8 256 8zM140 300h116v70.9c0 10.7 13 16.1 20.5 8.5l114.3-114.9c4.7-4.7 4.7-12.2 0-16.9l-114.3-115c-7.6-7.6-20.5-2.2-20.5 8.5V212H140c-6.6 0-12 5.4-12 12v64c0 6.6 5.4 12 12 12z\"></path></svg>			\n									Shop Now\n					</a>\n									<h2>Fall Line</h2>					<h2>Sneak Peek</h2>										<a href=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/shop-the-collection/\">\n				<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" viewBox=\"0 0 512 512\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M256 8c137 0 248 111 248 248S393 504 256 504 8 393 8 256 119 8 256 8zM140 300h116v70.9c0 10.7 13 16.1 20.5 8.5l114.3-114.9c4.7-4.7 4.7-12.2 0-16.9l-114.3-115c-7.6-7.6-20.5-2.2-20.5 8.5V212H140c-6.6 0-12 5.4-12 12v64c0 6.6 5.4 12 12 12z\"></path></svg>			\n									Take A Look\n					</a>\n							<a href=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/product-category/spring/\">\n														</a>\n						<h2><a href=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/product-category/spring/\">SPRING</a></h2>							\n							<a href=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/product-category/summer/\">\n														</a>\n						<h2><a href=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/product-category/summer/\">SUMMER\n</a></h2>							\n							<a href=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/product-category/fall/\">\n														</a>\n						<h2><a href=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/product-category/fall/\">FALL</a></h2>							\n							<a href=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/custom-orders/\">\n														</a>\n						<h2><a href=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/custom-orders/\">Custom Designs</a></h2>										<a href=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/shop-the-collection/\">\n									Shop Now\n					</a>\n									<h2>Join Our Newsletter\n</h2>															<img width=\"600\" height=\"800\" src=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-Leto-opt-in-Home-Page-1.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-Leto-opt-in-Home-Page-1.png 600w, https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-Leto-opt-in-Home-Page-