(1142, 1, '2025-10-27 23:01:29', '2025-10-27 23:01:29', '<img width=\"600\" height=\"900\" src=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Pink-Gown-Home-Page-Header.png\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Pink-Gown-Home-Page-Header.png 600w, https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Pink-Gown-Home-Page-Header-200x300.png 200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" />																<h2>Amber Leto <br>\nOne of a Kind Designs</h2>							\n				<p>Designed to Be the Main Character.</p><p>Step into a world where every outfit demands a spotlight. One-of-a-kind fashion for women who dare to be unforgettable.</p>								<a href=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/shop-the-collection/\">\n									View More\n					</a>\n									<h2>About the Designer\n</h2>							\n				<p>Amber Leto is a Scottsdale-based fashion designer with a lifelong passion for turning the ordinary into the extraordinary. With a gifted eye for color, detail, and drama, Amber creates one-ofa-kind gowns, bold denim pieces, and statement accessories that transform every entrance into a moment worth remembering. Before launching her brand, Amber earned multiple degrees in psychology — including a Doctorate in Clinical Psychology — and built a decades-long career helping people feel confident, safe, and empowered.</p>								<a href=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/about-the-designer/\">\n									Learn more\n					</a>\n																			<img width=\"504\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-About-page-504x1024.jpeg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-About-page-504x1024.jpeg 504w, https://checkyourproject.info/mockup/amberleto/website/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-Abo