(1169, 1, '2025-11-11 02:49:17', '2025-11-11 02:49:17', '', 'Photo Aug 29 2025, 9 14 49 PM (2)', '', 'inherit', 'open', 'closed', '', 'photo-aug-29-2025-9-14-49-pm-2', '', '', '2025-11-11 02:49:17', '2025-11-11 02:49:17', '', 380, 'https://amberleto.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Photo-Aug-29-2025-9-14-49-PM-2.jpg', 0, 'attachment', 'image/jpeg', 0),
(1170, 1, '2025-11-11 02:49:28', '2025-11-11 02:49:28', '', 'Photo Aug 29 2025, 9 14 49 PM (5)', '', 'inherit', 'open', 'closed', '', 'photo-aug-29-2025-9-14-49-pm-5', '', '', '2025-11-11 02:49:28', '2025-11-11 02:49:28', '', 380, 'https://amberleto.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Photo-Aug-29-2025-9-14-49-PM-5.jpg', 0, 'attachment', 'image/jpeg', 0),
(1171, 1, '2025-11-11 02:49:34', '2025-11-11 02:49:34', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>This is it—18 days until fashion history unfolds. On <em>Black Friday week</em>, in the heart of <em>Manhattan</em>, <strong>Amber Leto Designs</strong> <strong>inc</strong> opens the doors to something bold, intimate, and utterly unmissable: the first ever showroom pop-up where her full 2025 collection drops for purchase, in person, for one spectacular week only.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":1168,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://amberleto.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Photo-Aug-29-2025-9-14-49-PM-6-834x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1168\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Imagine stepping into a world where cutting-edge design meets elevated femininity—where structured cage silhouettes, feather-soft drapes, and power-play tailoring collide. This is the collection you’ve seen in lookbooks and whispers; this is the moment you touch it, try it, and claim it.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">CHOOSE THE RIGHT TRAVEL BAG FOR YOUR TRIP</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":1169,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://amberleto.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Photo-Aug-29-2025-9-14-49-PM-2-1024x824.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1169\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>It’s the <em>launch</em> of Amber’s brand-new 2025 line—this is her first showroom experience ever.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>It’s <em>live-and-in-person</em> in New York, so you’re not just shopping online—you’re stepping into the design studio, feeling the fabric, meeting the energy.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>It’s <em>exclusive</em>, with limited quantities and early-access perks for visitors.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>It’s tied to the Black Friday momentum—so expect surprises: drop-ins, styling sessions, maybe a few one-of-a-kind pieces you won’t find again</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">WHAT TO EXPECT:</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>When you arrive, the space is transformed into her design realm: movement-forward lighting, curated racks of dresses, suits, separates—all 2025 pieces. Think “Mad About Plaid” meets “Future Femme”. Think bold colors, architectural cuts, fearless details. A look from her recent “Powder Blue Cage Dress (Flamenco Fantasy Gown)” moment? That energy radiates through.<br>You’ll be greeted with glam-touched styling stations, maybe a champagne (mocktail) toast, and the kind of vibe where you know you’re discovering something before the rest of the world. Some pieces will be tagged “first come, first served”. Some looks might debut at the showroom and be gone in hours</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":1170,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://amberleto.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Photo-Aug-29-2025-9-14-49-PM-5-1024x819.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1170\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">WHY YOU NEED TO BE HERE:</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Because owning a piece of Amber’s 2025 line <em>now</em> isn’t just shopping—it’s investing. It’s saying: I was here at the beginning. I walked in when it was new. I own a piece of that launch energy. And the next time you wear it? You’ll know exactly where it came from.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>Plus, the network: fellow fashion-forward women and men, influencers, media, stylists—this is where new connections spark.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>And the exclusivity: when you shop this showroom, you’re part of a select group. You’re stepping into the inner circle of Amber’s brand journey.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>The clock is ticking.</strong></li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>With just 18 days to go, the invite is live at [posh.vip link]—reserve your slot, mark your calendar, bring your A-game. Walk in ready to feel empowered, inspired, and ready to claim your standout piece from the 2025 collection.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li>This isn’t just shopping—it’s a moment. And it might be <em>everything</em>.<br><br>See you in NYC. Be ready.</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://posh.vip/e/amber-leto-designs-exclusive-black-friday-pop-up\" data-type=\"link\" data-id=\"https://posh.vip/e/amber-leto-designs-exclusive-black-friday-pop-up\">RSVP HERE</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"lightbox\":{\"enabled\":false},\"id\":1167,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"custom\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"https://amberleto.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Nov-28-Pop-Up-Market-Flyer-6-791x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-1167\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Unlock the Unexpected: Amber Leto Designs’ 2025 Collections Make Their Live Debut in NYC', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '380-revision-v1', '', '', '2025-11-11 02:49:34', '2025-11-11 02:49:34', '', 380, 'https://amberleto.com/?p=1171', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(1175, 1, '2026-02-10 19:59:11', '2026-02-10 19:59:11', '<span class=\"a_GcMg font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\">This structured cotton-poplin mini is a floral fantasy in motion. Featuring dimensional hand-sculpted rosettes that frame the neckline and a romantic floral appliqué belt detail, the look is effortlessly flirty yet powerfully feminine. Paired with a soft blush satin drape for added elegance, it’s perfect for cocktail affairs, upscale luncheons, or red carpet debuts with a playful twist.</span>', 'Rose in Bloom', '<strong>Lorem Ipsum</strong> is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '151-autosave-v1', '', '', '2026-02-10 19:59:11', '2026-02-10 19:59:11', '', 151, 'https://amberleto.com/?p=1175', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(1176, 1, '2026-02-10 20:03:33', '2026-02-10 20:03:33', '<span class=\"a_GcMg font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\">This hot pink statement dress stuns with exaggerated ruffle details and a cascading tiered high-low skirt. The fitted bodice features a bold appliqué flower design accented with pearls, balanced by voluminous ruffle shoulders for couture-level drama. Crafted in polyester with no stretch, the silhouette holds its shape while delivering maximum movement and flair. Designed for standout moments, this “long ass dress” is playful, fearless, and unforgettable.</span>', 'Petal Fantasy', '<strong>Lorem Ipsum</strong> is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '191-autosave-v1', '', '', '2026-02-10 20:03:33', '2026-02-10 20:03:33', '', 191, 'https://amberleto.com/?p=1176', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
(1177, 1, '2026-02-10 20:11:59', '2026-02-10 20:11:59', '<p class=\"cvGsUA direction-ltr align-justify para-style-body\"><span class=\"a_GcMg font-feature-liga-off font-feature-clig-off font-feature-calt-off text-decoration-none text-strikethrough-none\">A radiant burst of color and texture, this neon citrus mini is crafted for the bold and the beautiful. Iridescent sequin fabric forms the structured base, while cascading layers of lime tulle and an oversized sculptural flower add playful drama and haute couture flair. Finished with mesh drapes and a matching lace choker, this look is pure sunshine with a wink of rebellion.</span></p>', 'Citrus Bloom Mini', '<strong>Lorem Ipsum</strong> is simply dummy text of the printing and typesetting industry. Lorem Ipsum has been the industry\'s standard dummy text ever since the 1500s, when an unknown printer took a galley of type and scrambled it to make a type specimen book.', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '154-autosave-v1', '', '', '2026-02-10 20:11:59', '2026-02-10 20:11:59', '', 154, 'https://amberleto.com/?p=1177', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
