(1196, 1, '2026-03-03 20:01:52', '2026-03-03 20:01:52', 'https://amberleto.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/cropped-logo.png', 'cropped-logo.png', '', 'inherit', 'open', 'closed', '', 'cropped-logo-png', '', '', '2026-03-03 20:01:52', '2026-03-03 20:01:52', '', 289, 'https://amberleto.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/cropped-logo.png', 0, 'attachment', 'image/png', 0),
(1198, 1, '2026-03-07 22:29:02', '2026-03-07 22:29:02', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The fashion industry continues to celebrate bold creativity and fearless individuality, and Amber is receiving well-deserved recognition for her artistic contributions to the fashion world.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Known for her theatrical aesthetic, handcrafted detailing, and unapologetically expressive style, Amber Leto has built a reputation for creating garments that are more than clothing, they are wearable art. Her work blends statement textures, custom embellishments, dramatic silhouettes, and playful couture elements that turn every look into a conversation piece.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Recently, Amber was honored with an industry award from Anastasia Magazine recognizing her dedication to creativity, originality, and innovation in fashion design. The recognition highlights not only her artistic vision but also her commitment to pushing boundaries within independent fashion.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Through her brands, <em>Amber Leto Designs</em> <em>and No Vacancies by Amber Leto,</em> she continues to craft statement pieces ranging from couture garments and custom accessories to her signature embellished sunglasses and theatrical runway looks. Her designs celebrate individuality and empower wearers to embrace their own unique sense of style.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The award serves as another milestone in Amber’s growing influence within the fashion community. Her designs have captured the attention of stylists, creatives, and fashion lovers who appreciate artistry that refuses to conform to traditional expectations.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As Amber Leto continues to evolve her brand and expand her creative reach, this recognition stands as a powerful reminder that authenticity and originality remain some of the most valuable currencies in fashion.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For Amber, this honor is just the beginning of an even bigger journey.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Join her during this time of celebration March 14th, Anastasia Hollywood Talent Awards, Los Angeles</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://www.eventbrite.com/e/neiman-marcus-couture-pageant-fashion-show-las-vegas-tickets-1980832347875?utm-campaign=social&amp;utm-content=attendeeshare&amp;utm-medium=discovery&amp;utm-term=listing&amp;utm-source=cp&amp;aff=ebdsshcopyurl\" data-type=\"link\" data-id=\"https://www.eventbrite.com/e/neiman-marcus-couture-pageant-fashion-show-las-vegas-tickets-1980832347875?utm-campaign=social&amp;utm-content=attendeeshare&amp;utm-medium=discovery&amp;utm-term=listing&amp;utm-source=cp&amp;aff=ebdsshcopyurl\">Awards Ceremony &amp; Fashion Show</a> | Sunset Rooftop 777 N Ocean Dr, Hollywood FL 33019 | 2:00 pm</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Amber Leto Honored With Industry Recognition for Her One-of-a-Kind Designs', '', 'publish', 'open', 'open', '', 'amber-leto-honored-with-industry-recognition-for-her-one-of-a-kind-designs', '', '', '2026-03-07 22:29:02', '2026-03-07 22:29:02', '', 0, 'https://amberleto.com/?p=1198', 0, 'post', '', 0),
(1199, 1, '2026-03-07 22:29:02', '2026-03-07 22:29:02', '<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The fashion industry continues to celebrate bold creativity and fearless individuality, and Amber is receiving well-deserved recognition for her artistic contributions to the fashion world.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Known for her theatrical aesthetic, handcrafted detailing, and unapologetically expressive style, Amber Leto has built a reputation for creating garments that are more than clothing, they are wearable art. Her work blends statement textures, custom embellishments, dramatic silhouettes, and playful couture elements that turn every look into a conversation piece.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Recently, Amber was honored with an industry award from Anastasia Magazine recognizing her dedication to creativity, originality, and innovation in fashion design. The recognition highlights not only her artistic vision but also her commitment to pushing boundaries within independent fashion.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Through her brands, <em>Amber Leto Designs</em> <em>and No Vacancies by Amber Leto,</em> she continues to craft statement pieces ranging from couture garments and custom accessories to her signature embellished sunglasses and theatrical runway looks. Her designs celebrate individuality and empower wearers to embrace their own unique sense of style.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>The award serves as another milestone in Amber’s growing influence within the fashion community. Her designs have captured the attention of stylists, creatives, and fashion lovers who appreciate artistry that refuses to conform to traditional expectations.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>As Amber Leto continues to evolve her brand and expand her creative reach, this recognition stands as a powerful reminder that authenticity and originality remain some of the most valuable currencies in fashion.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>For Amber, this honor is just the beginning of an even bigger journey.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Join her during this time of celebration March 14th, Anastasia Hollywood Talent Awards, Los Angeles</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://www.eventbrite.com/e/neiman-marcus-couture-pageant-fashion-show-las-vegas-tickets-1980832347875?utm-campaign=social&amp;utm-content=attendeeshare&amp;utm-medium=discovery&amp;utm-term=listing&amp;utm-source=cp&amp;aff=ebdsshcopyurl\" data-type=\"link\" data-id=\"https://www.eventbrite.com/e/neiman-marcus-couture-pageant-fashion-show-las-vegas-tickets-1980832347875?utm-campaign=social&amp;utm-content=attendeeshare&amp;utm-medium=discovery&amp;utm-term=listing&amp;utm-source=cp&amp;aff=ebdsshcopyurl\">Awards Ceremony &amp; Fashion Show</a> | Sunset Rooftop 777 N Ocean Dr, Hollywood FL 33019 | 2:00 pm</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->', 'Amber Leto Honored With Industry Recognition for Her One-of-a-Kind Designs', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '1198-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-03-07 22:29:02', '2026-03-07 22:29:02', '', 1198, 'https://amberleto.com/?p=1199', 0, 'revision', '', 0);
