(1213, 1, '2026-04-03 15:23:26', '2026-04-03 15:23:26', '<h2>About The <br>Designer\n</h2>							\n				<p>My life was always better with a bow.</p>			<h2>Meet Amber Leto</h2>							\n				<p>Amber Leto is a Scottsdale-based fashion designer with a lifelong passion for turning the ordinary into the extraordinary. With a gifted eye for color, detail, and drama, Amber creates one-ofa-kind gowns, bold denim pieces, and statement accessories that transform every entrance into a moment worth remembering. Before launching her brand, Amber earned multiple degrees in psychology — including a Doctorate in Clinical Psychology — and built a decades-long career helping people feel confident, safe, and empowered.</p><p>That same drive to uplift others now fuels her fashion work, where each design is handcrafted to celebrate individuality and inspire main-character energy.</p>													<img width=\"504\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://amberleto.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-About-page-504x1024.jpeg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://amberleto.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-About-page-504x1024.jpeg 504w, https://amberleto.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-About-page-600x1219.jpeg 600w, https://amberleto.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-About-page-148x300.jpeg 148w, https://amberleto.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-About-page.jpeg 640w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 504px) 100vw, 504px\" />																		\n																	<img width=\"800\" height=\"1000\" src=\"https://amberleto.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-Leto-Group-Shot-scaled-1-819x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://amberleto.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-Leto-Group-Shot-scaled-1-819x1024.jpg 819w, https://amberleto.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-Leto-Group-Shot-scaled-1-600x750.jpg 600w, https://amberleto.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-Leto-Group-Shot-scaled-1-240x300.jpg 240w, https://amberleto.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-Leto-Group-Shot-scaled-1-768x960.jpg 768w, https://amberleto.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-Leto-Group-Shot-scaled-1-1229x1536.jpg 1229w, https://amberleto.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-Leto-Group-Shot-scaled-1-1638x2048.jpg 1638w, https://amberleto.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-Leto-Group-Shot-scaled-1.jpg 2048w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 800px) 100vw, 800px\" />													<p>Amber also lives with <strong>Ehlers-Danlos Syndrome (EDS)</strong>, a rare and often debilitating connective tissue disorder. While EDS brings its challenges, it has never stopped her from creating, innovating, and pushing the limits of what’s possible in fashion. In fact, her perseverance through adversity is stitched into every piece — a reminder that beauty and strength can coexist in the most dazzling ways.</p><p>Her style is theatrical, unapologetically feminine, and rooted in maximalism. From untamed leopard prints to oversized bows and glittering embellishments, Amber’s pieces dare women to be seen, to be unforgettable, and to never apologize for stealing the show.</p><p>As the creator of <strong>Amber Leto Designs ™ + No Vacancies by Amber Leto ™</strong> , she continues to push boundaries, creating couture-meetscostume collections for fearless women around the world. Because in Amber’s world, fashion isn’t just worn — it’s experienced.</p><p><em>“I don’t just design clothes… I dress moments.”</em></p>			<h2>Timeless Silhouettes. Modern Edge. \n</h2>							\n				<p>Nulla eleifend scelerisque vulputate. Mauris lobortis a mauris eu convallis. Morbi vulputate nisi eget maximus vehicula. Vestibulum mattis consectetur ligula, id suscipit quam dapibus vel. Maecenas molestie.</p><p>Enim sit amet suscipit imperdiet, justo diam semper leo, quis finibus sapien eros et est. In hac habitasse platea dictumst. Etiam non dolor dapibus ligula mollis ornare vulputate eget elit. Maecenas bibendum placerat.</p>													<img width=\"504\" height=\"1024\" src=\"https://amberleto.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-About-page-504x1024.jpeg\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https://amberleto.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-About-page-504x1024.jpeg 504w, https://amberleto.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-About-page-600x1219.jpeg 600w, https://amberleto.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-About-page-148x300.jpeg 148w, https://amberleto.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/10/Amber-About-page.jpeg 640w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 504px) 100vw, 504px\" />																<h2>Amber – TBD\n</h2>							\n				<p>Nulla eleifend scelerisque vulputate. Mauris lobortis a mauris eu convallis. Morbi vulputate nisi eget maximus vehicula. Vestibulum mattis consectetur.</p>			<h2>Stay in Touch\n</h2>					<h2>Location\n</h2>		Arizona\n			<h2>Phone Number</h2>		<p>619-994-2237</p>			<h2>Contact\n</h2>		<p><a href=\"mailto:info@amberleto.com\">info@amberleto.com</a></p>			<h2>Hours</h2>		<p><strong>M – F : </strong>8am–5pm</p><p><strong>Sat</strong> : 11am–6pm</p><p><strong>Sun</strong> : Closed</p>', 'About the Designer', '', 'inherit', 'closed', 'closed', '', '269-revision-v1', '', '', '2026-04-03 15:23:26', '2026-04-03 15:23:26', '', 269, 'https://amberleto.com/?p=1213', 0, 'revision', '', 0),
